<p xml:id="subtitle962" begin="25528840002t" end="25546772500t" region="region107" style="style0">(BEK SERU)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle963" begin="25765332508t" end="25777002500t" region="region76" style="style0">Anda juga tidak boleh.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle964" begin="25963027506t" end="25976785000t" region="region37" style="style0">(MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle965" begin="26053117506t" end="26068962502t" region="region1" style="style0">(TERUS MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle966" begin="26090235003t" end="26104002507t" region="region37" style="style0">(BEK TERKECIK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle967" begin="26356747500t" end="26388030001t" region="region54" style="style0">awak!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle968" begin="26356747500t" end="26388030001t" region="region60" style="style0">dan menjauhi saya. diam saja</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle969" begin="26403467506t" end="26434332507t" region="region54" style="style0">(MERENGANG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle970" begin="26403467506t" end="26434332507t" region="region36" style="style0">anda tidak termasuk dalam pertempuran. gadis cantik,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle971" begin="26452682506t" end="26471450003t" region="region42" style="style0">Bakar dia!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle972" begin="26507732500t" end="26527335000t" region="region23" style="style0">(BERDESIK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle973" begin="26507732500t" end="26527335000t" region="region55" style="style0">Alangkah indahnya makhlukmu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle974" begin="26527335000t" end="26554870007t" region="region28" style="style0">Biar saya bantu awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle975" begin="26527335000t" end="26554870007t" region="region0" style="style0">ASTARTE: Bakar dia!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle976" begin="26554870007t" end="26582812506t" region="region28" style="style0">Awak sangat sejuk.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle977" begin="26554870007t" end="26582812506t" region="region10" style="style0">Panaskan diri. saya perintahkan awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle978" begin="26582812506t" end="26597822500t" region="region44" style="style0">(MENGERAM)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle979" begin="26597822500t" end="26616590000t" region="region0" style="style0">(MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle980" begin="26597822500t" end="26616590000t" region="region40" style="style0">dengan pantas.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle981" begin="26626192508t" end="26644960007t" region="region5" style="style0">(MERENGANG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle982" begin="26644960007t" end="26666640000t" region="region21" style="style0">(MULA MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle983" begin="26644960007t" end="26666640000t" region="region36" style="style0">adalah lebih baik. Syarikat anda</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle984" begin="26677067500t" end="26691670003t" region="region39" style="style0">HORUS: Keterlaluan!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle985" begin="26691670003t" end="26712942506t" region="region4" style="style0">HATHOR: Anda dialu-alukan kerana menyelamatkan nyawa anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle986" begin="26691670003t" end="26712942506t" region="region27" style="style0">Maka semasa aku duduk buta di dalam kubur ayahku,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle987" begin="26712942506t" end="26724205006t" region="region44" style="style0">katil dengan tuhan yang anda kongsi</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle988" begin="26724205006t" end="26750895003t" region="region18" style="style0">yang mencabut mata saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle989" begin="26750895003t" end="26767157500t" region="region32" style="style0">pada seseorang yang tidak dapat melihat? Mengapa saya akan membazirkan ini</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle990" begin="26750895003t" end="26767157500t" region="region25" style="style0">Kenapa saya percaya awak lagi?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle991" begin="26767157500t" end="26785100007t" region="region53" style="style0">Dia membunuh semua tuhan yang tidak akan tunduk kepadanya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle992" begin="26785100007t" end="26809702502t" region="region28" style="style0">Itu termasuk saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle993" begin="26785100007t" end="26809702502t" region="region0" style="style0">Kami menceroboh kuil Set.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle994" begin="26820130002t" end="26835567508t" region="region76" style="style0">Horus akan membunuhnya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle995" begin="26887695000t" end="26917307500t" region="region33" style="style0">merancang untuk masuk? Apa khabar</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle996" begin="26887695000t" end="26917307500t" region="region3" style="style0">Dia?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle997" begin="26929405001t" end="26949425001t" region="region23" style="style0">Dia telah melihat rancangan itu. Dia tahu jalannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle998" begin="26929405001t" end="26949425001t" region="region60" style="style0">Adakah anda sudah lupa tentang itu? Bagaimana dengan Sphinx?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle999" begin="26993640006t" end="27006979999t" region="region65" style="style0">"Sphinx"?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1000" begin="27277667500t" end="27295192507t" region="region43" style="style0">untuk menjaga apinya. Set menangkapnya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1001" begin="27277667500t" end="27295192507t" region="region1" style="style0">Ia akan membunuh tanpa belas kasihan semua yang masuk</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1002" begin="27314795006t" end="27331892503t" region="region30" style="style0">jawab teka-tekinya. jika mereka tidak boleh</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1003" begin="27314795006t" end="27331892503t" region="region75" style="style0">teka-teki, kan? Anda boleh menjawab</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1004" begin="27331892503t" end="27348155000t" region="region18" style="style0">Thoth untuk bantuan. Kami akan bertanya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1005" begin="27348155000t" end="27364427506t" region="region43" style="style0">(SCOFFS) Kenapa awak sengaja buat macam tu?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1006" begin="27348155000t" end="27364427506t" region="region39" style="style0">daripada yang sangat diperlukan. Jadi kita tidak perlu mati lebih awal</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1007" begin="27364427506t" end="27387777500t" region="region0" style="style0">jom pergi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1008" begin="27364427506t" end="27387777500t" region="region36" style="style0">Adakah dia memberi awak pakaian itu?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1009" begin="27387777500t" end="27399875001t" region="region40" style="style0">apa yang disediakan. Saya memilih daripada</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1010" begin="27399875001t" end="27412807505t" region="region10" style="style0">yang anda fikir Jadi anda pilih</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1011" begin="27399875001t" end="27412807505t" region="region39" style="style0">akan paling menggembirakannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1012" begin="27412807505t" end="27435750007t" region="region36" style="style0">Saya berpakaian untuk menggembirakan diri sendiri. HORUS: Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1013" begin="27435750007t" end="27458265000t" region="region3" style="style0">kenapa? Anda tidak menyukainya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1014" begin="27458265000t" end="27476625008t" region="region23" style="style0">Ia terlalu banyak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1015" begin="27458265000t" end="27476625008t" region="region89" style="style0">Saya adalah Dewi Terlalu Banyak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1016" begin="27476625008t" end="27488295000t" region="region40" style="style0">Dan ada banyak yang saya telah berikan kepada anda</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1017" begin="27498305000t" end="27522917505t" region="region40" style="style0">anda tidak pernah mendapati berlebihan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1018" begin="27498305000t" end="27522917505t" region="region38" style="style0">Ah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1019" begin="27522917505t" end="27552112503t" region="region108" style="style0">Sekarang mungkin terlalu sedikit.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1020" begin="27522917505t" end="27552112503t" region="region52" style="style0">Anda tidak pernah begitu sukar untuk menyenangkan hati.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1021" begin="27522917505t" end="27552112503t" region="region39" style="style0">Anda melambatkan kami.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1022" begin="27552112503t" end="27587977500t" region="region84" style="style0">Ooh.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1023" begin="27552112503t" end="27587977500t" region="region10" style="style0">Saya fikir ia membuatkan anda kelihatan nakal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1024" begin="27552112503t" end="27587977500t" region="region59" style="style0">Apakah rupa saya sebelum ini?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1025" begin="27587977500t" end="27600075001t" region="region46" style="style0">-Tidak sedar. -Oh!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1026" begin="27587977500t" end="27600075001t" region="region61" style="style0">Tetapi dengan cara yang comel.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1027" begin="27610085001t" end="27640115001t" region="region56" style="style0">Tidak sedar apa?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1028" begin="27610085001t" end="27640115001t" region="region63" style="style0">Tepat sekali. Awak selalu menganggap saya remeh.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1029" begin="27640115001t" end="27657629999t" region="region23" style="style0">apa?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1030" begin="27640115001t" end="27657629999t" region="region60" style="style0">Dengan mata anda kembali, anda sepatutnya datang untuk mendapatkan saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1031" begin="27663892506t" end="27682660003t" region="region85" style="style0">-Tidakkah saya cukup bermakna kepada anda? -Oh?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1032" begin="27682660003t" end="27709767501t" region="region54" style="style0">(HATHOR MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1033" begin="27682660003t" end="27709767501t" region="region3" style="style0">(TERGAS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1034" begin="27709767501t" end="27735215006t" region="region26" style="style0">(KETAWA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1035" begin="27709767501t" end="27735215006t" region="region40" style="style0">Jadilah sayang dan ambilkan saya air bersih.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1036" begin="27834062506t" end="27862422503t" region="region52" style="style0">Adakah ia akan membunuh anda untuk mengatakan "tolong"?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1037" begin="27834062506t" end="27862422503t" region="region42" style="style0">dalam mood nak berdebat. Saya benar-benar tidak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1038" begin="27862422503t" end="27885782507t" region="region53" style="style0">Pergi ambil untuk saya. saya perintahkan awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1039" begin="27862422503t" end="27885782507t" region="region51" style="style0">Anda semua sama, bukan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1040" begin="28023000003t" end="28048437500t" region="region28" style="style0">siapa nama dia?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1041" begin="28023000003t" end="28048437500t" region="region17" style="style0">Saya boleh membuat mana-mana lelaki, wanita, tuhan atau binatang melakukan perintah saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1042" begin="28048437500t" end="28061787502t" region="region42" style="style0">Melainkan hati mereka milik orang lain.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1043" begin="28048437500t" end="28061787502t" region="region83" style="style0">awak sedang jatuh cinta.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1044" begin="28073050003t" end="28088059999t" region="region36" style="style0">Nama dia Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1045" begin="28090982502t" end="28108915000t" region="region61" style="style0">saya minta maaf sangat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1046" begin="28108915000t" end="28129770001t" region="region41" style="style0">Saya berjanji kepadanya rumah yang sesuai.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1047" begin="28108915000t" end="28129770001t" region="region55" style="style0">Wang untuk keluarga. Kehormatan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1048" begin="28152295003t" end="28165645006t" region="region1" style="style0">Saya tidak memberinya apa-apa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1049" begin="28152295003t" end="28165645006t" region="region46" style="style0">Oh, dia tidak akan bersama anda</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1050" begin="28172732503t" end="28191917502t" region="region4" style="style0">jika dia tidak mencintai awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1051" begin="28172732503t" end="28191917502t" region="region13" style="style0">Percayalah, saya tahu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1052" begin="28204432506t" end="28220695001t" region="region44" style="style0">Saya akan menebusnya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1053" begin="28220695001t" end="28237385008t" region="region0" style="style0">Tetapi saya fikir dia...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1054" begin="28220695001t" end="28237385008t" region="region89" style="style0">untuk membawanya kembali. Horus akan pergi</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1055" begin="28251142502t" end="28267415008t" region="region5" style="style0">Dia cakap macam tu?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1056" begin="28267415008t" end="28281172502t" region="region44" style="style0">Saya tahu sukar untuk melihat masa lalunya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1057" begin="28267415008t" end="28281172502t" region="region75" style="style0">dan pengisytiharan balas dendam tetapi... pendek baran</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1058" begin="28288677500t" end="28308697500t" region="region76" style="style0">Dia tidak begitu teruk.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1059" begin="28308697500t" end="28323717505t" region="region97" style="style0">Sukar untuk dilihat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1060" begin="28308697500t" end="28323717505t" region="region27" style="style0">Itu dia.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1061" begin="28367932508t" end="28383360003t" region="region40" style="style0">(METALLIC RATTLE)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1062" begin="28598987500t" end="28618589999t" region="region36" style="style0">BEK: Adakah itu dia?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1063" begin="28708272508t" end="28721612502t" region="region44" style="style0">-Sudah tentu tidak. -Mereka?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1064" begin="28905967506t" end="28937667508t" region="region35" style="style0">Lalu siapakah mereka? (TERGAS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1065" begin="28905967506t" end="28937667508t" region="region28" style="style0">hamba-hambanya yang dipercayai.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1066" begin="28946425006t" end="28962270002t" region="region18" style="style0">Dia hanya mempercayai dirinya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1067" begin="28962270002t" end="28989377500t" region="region71" style="style0">Kaya dengan kompos yang banyak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1068" begin="28962270002t" end="28989377500t" region="region36" style="style0">Berwarna-warni.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1069" begin="29009397500t" end="29031505001t" region="region19" style="style0">Terutamanya dalam spektrum hijau dan merah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1070" begin="29031505001t" end="29049855000t" region="region23" style="style0">Varieti beraneka ragam dengan perbungaan terdiri daripada berbilang kuntum,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1071" begin="29031505001t" end="29049855000t" region="region55" style="style0">setiap satu dengan kelopak yang diubah suai.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1072" begin="29061117501t" end="29074467505t" region="region71" style="style0">Tuhan Firman Suci yang Bijaksana, kami meminta nasihat-Mu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1073" begin="29061117501t" end="29074467505t" region="region89" style="style0">tercabut dan dibakar. Sekali, lalang,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1074" begin="29094070003t" end="29109915000t" region="region13" style="style0">untuk kekuatan minyaknya Kini dihargai</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1075" begin="29109915000t" end="29130352500t" region="region27" style="style0">dan rezeki daunnya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1076" begin="29109915000t" end="29130352500t" region="region0" style="style0">Tetapi apakah kebenarannya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1077" begin="29143285003t" end="29190412500t" region="region0" style="style0">awak! pusing balik.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1078" begin="29143285003t" end="29190412500t" region="region89" style="style0">pandangan dari belakang? Anda lebih suka</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1079" begin="29190412500t" end="29215025005t" region="region48" style="style0">Tidak, saya... Ya, ya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1080" begin="29190412500t" end="29215025005t" region="region107" style="style0">Awak tahu saya tidak boleh berbohong. pusing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1081" begin="29227957508t" end="29241297501t" region="region36" style="style0">Saya tidak akan mengambil risiko</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1082" begin="29227957508t" end="29241297501t" region="region88" style="style0">memandang matamu yang licik itu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1083" begin="29241297501t" end="29255065005t" region="region13" style="style0">-Empat puluh tujuh. -Maafkan saya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1084" begin="29241297501t" end="29255065005t" region="region82" style="style0">Peratusan ilmu yang saya catat setakat ini.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1085" begin="29258822508t" end="29272997502t" region="region13" style="style0">Saya belum lagi separuh.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1086" begin="29289677500t" end="29304697505t" region="region18" style="style0">-Jawapan kepada teka-teki -Thoth, saya hanya perlukan... Sphinx.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1087" begin="29317630007t" end="29337650007t" region="region44" style="style0">Seorang kanak-kanak boleh menyimpulkan mengapa anda berada di sini.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1088" begin="29337650007t" end="29358505008t" region="region45" style="style0">Pergi tanya teka-teki</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1089" begin="29337650007t" end="29358505008t" region="region38" style="style0">dan sampaikan kepada saya. dan kembali</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1090" begin="29337650007t" end="29358505008t" region="region25" style="style0">Saya akan menyelesaikannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1091" begin="29369757500t" end="29389777500t" region="region109" style="style0">Salah seorang daripada kita perlu mati.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1092" begin="29369757500t" end="29389777500t" region="region36" style="style0">Nah, lukis banyak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1093" begin="29389777500t" end="29402292502t" region="region61" style="style0">-Mari bersama kami. -Ha!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1094" begin="29425652506t" end="29444002503t" region="region27" style="style0">-Saya akan memberi anda satu malam. -Suatu malam. Hmm...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1095" begin="29479867500t" end="29499887500t" region="region18" style="style0">Tidak, anda tidak akan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1096" begin="29499887500t" end="29520742500t" region="region23" style="style0">sebelum dia membinasakan kita semua. Set mesti dihentikan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1097" begin="29499887500t" end="29520742500t" region="region39" style="style0">Anda lihat hikmahnya, bukan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1098" begin="29564540003t" end="29576637506t" region="region42" style="style0">terlalu penting untuk mengambil risiko. Ini jauh</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1099" begin="29625017505t" end="29639202508t" region="region76" style="style0">nama sebenar bintang. saya boleh mengaji</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1100" begin="29668815008t" end="29680902500t" region="region37" style="style0">saya tahu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1101" begin="29730117500t" end="29752642502t" region="region11" style="style0">Saya telah melihat dunia yang dicipta daripada pasir dan air.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1102" begin="29752642502t" end="29779749999t" region="region13" style="style0">Mmm-hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1103" begin="29752642502t" end="29779749999t" region="region51" style="style0">Saya mengandungi semua kebijaksanaan di alam semesta.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1104" begin="29786012506t" end="29797275006t" region="region49" style="style0">Lebih berharga daripada beberapa mahkota.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1105" begin="29925317505t" end="29939909999t" region="region39" style="style0">Ha! Saya ada!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1106" begin="29955347505t" end="29970357500t" region="region30" style="style0">Misterinya. Intipatinya. Kebenarannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1107" begin="29970357500t" end="29982872502t" region="region5" style="style0">Ia adalah salad!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1108" begin="30010397500t" end="30027505006t" region="region66" style="style0">menjatuhkan pengawalnya. ayah awak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1109" begin="30027505006t" end="30042515001t" region="region21" style="style0">Itu bukan sahaja sangat bodoh,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1110" begin="30027505006t" end="30042515001t" region="region25" style="style0">untuk menulis segala-galanya tetapi sekarang saya terpaksa saya tahu</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1111" begin="30042515001t" end="30057535006t" region="region32" style="style0">kemungkinan jauh sebagai pertahanan terhadap</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1112" begin="30042515001t" end="30057535006t" region="region30" style="style0">bahawa perang Set menemui saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1113" begin="30057535006t" end="30083390002t" region="region56" style="style0">Saya minta maaf bahawa mayat ibu bapa saya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1114" begin="30083390002t" end="30102992502t" region="region5" style="style0">telah menyusahkan anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1115" begin="30102992502t" end="30115507505t" region="region58" style="style0">Permintaan maaf diterima. Sekarang, keluar!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1116" begin="30115507505t" end="30128022507t" region="region13" style="style0">Tetapi anda perlu membantu kami!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1117" begin="30141362500t" end="30173480002t" region="region53" style="style0">(PEDANG BERKATA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1118" begin="30141362500t" end="30173480002t" region="region54" style="style0">THOTH: Berhati-hati.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1119" begin="30173480002t" end="30195587505t" region="region28" style="style0">Saya melebihi jumlah anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1120" begin="30173480002t" end="30195587505t" region="region32" style="style0">Whoa, whoa, whoa!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1121" begin="30202675001t" end="30221025000t" region="region1" style="style0">tak mengapa. Saya akan buat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1122" begin="30221025000t" end="30245220003t" region="region3" style="style0">Saya fikir awak adalah babun sesat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1123" begin="30221025000t" end="30245220003t" region="region0" style="style0">Saya beritahu awak saya yang akan berhadapan dengan Sphinx.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1124" begin="30245220003t" end="30260647500t" region="region25" style="style0">Peluang kegagalan anda amat besar.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1125" begin="30260647500t" end="30270657500t" region="region51" style="style0">Tetapi sebelum ia membunuh saya, saya pasti.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1126" begin="30260647500t" end="30270657500t" region="region55" style="style0">Saya akan memberitahu bahawa saya bertanya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1127" begin="30281502500t" end="30323212502t" region="region41" style="style0">Tuhan Kebijaksanaan yang akan datang</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1128" begin="30281502500t" end="30323212502t" region="region40" style="style0">dia akan mendapat jawapan yang salah. tetapi dia takut</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1129" begin="30323212502t" end="30352825001t" region="region27" style="style0">Ini adalah strategi paling bijak yang boleh anda buat?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1130" begin="30323212502t" end="30352825001t" region="region108" style="style0">mempermainkan ego saya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1131" begin="30323212502t" end="30352825001t" region="region83" style="style0">Betapa sia-sianya saya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1132" begin="30352825001t" end="30374097502t" region="region3" style="style0">Um... Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1133" begin="30352825001t" end="30374097502t" region="region51" style="style0">Ya, baiklah...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1134" begin="30399545008t" end="30419147508t" region="region5" style="style0">baiklah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1135" begin="30419147508t" end="30437497506t" region="region103" style="style0">baiklah!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1136" begin="30419147508t" end="30437497506t" region="region44" style="style0">jom pergi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1137" begin="30419147508t" end="30437497506t" region="region63" style="style0">Selamat tinggal.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1138" begin="30437497506t" end="30448342507t" region="region3" style="style0">Syabas.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1139" begin="30455012503t" end="30474615003t" region="region40" style="style0">terima kasih.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1140" begin="30474615003t" end="30490877500t" region="region40" style="style0">HATHOR: Anda tahu Zayanya tidak boleh kembali.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1141" begin="30490877500t" end="30509237508t" region="region33" style="style0">Raja tidak mempunyai kuasa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1142" begin="30490877500t" end="30509237508t" region="region1" style="style0">Anubis tidak mempunyai kuasa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1143" begin="30509237508t" end="30525917505t" region="region23" style="style0">Awak tipu dia.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1144" begin="30509237508t" end="30525917505t" region="region99" style="style0">Dia mungkin akan mati ke dalam piramid Set. cuba pecah</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1145" begin="30525917505t" end="30538015006t" region="region27" style="style0">Dia menawarkan nyawanya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1146" begin="30561782500t" end="30575967505t" region="region76" style="style0">Kerana dia fikir dia boleh menyelamatkannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1147" begin="30588900007t" end="30600987500t" region="region30" style="style0">Dia percaya apa yang dia mahu percaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1148" begin="30751137500t" end="30765740003t" region="region37" style="style0">dalam lebih daripada satu cara. Anda telah buta</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1149" begin="30765740003t" end="30778672507t" region="region25" style="style0">Anda benar-benar melihat dunia wujud?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1150" begin="30784925003t" end="30800769999t" region="region21" style="style0">saya tak tipu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1151" begin="30784925003t" end="30800769999t" region="region39" style="style0">menontonnya dari, Di manakah anda</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1152" begin="30867927506t" end="30880849999t" region="region28" style="style0">jika belum ada yang dicipta?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1153" begin="30884190002t" end="30901287500t" region="region36" style="style0">Jika saya cuba menjelaskan,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1154" begin="30901287500t" end="30911297500t" region="region0" style="style0">otak anda akan cair dan kehabisan telinga anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1155" begin="30901287500t" end="30911297500t" region="region60" style="style0">jalan balas dendam. Saya tidak memilih</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1156" begin="30927152506t" end="30950919999t" region="region28" style="style0">Saya tidak memilih satu pun daripada ini.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1157" begin="30961347500t" end="30973862502t" region="region25" style="style0">Awak beritahu saya apa jenis kuasa yang saya ada?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1158" begin="30973862502t" end="30991377500t" region="region76" style="style0">Anda mempunyai kuasa untuk membetulkannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1159" begin="30991377500t" end="31007232506t" region="region51" style="style0">untuk mengetahui kebenaran. Dia layak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1160" begin="30991377500t" end="31007232506t" region="region42" style="style0">Saya perlukan dia untuk membawa kita masuk untuk mencekik api Set.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1161" begin="31007232506t" end="31020989999t" region="region32" style="style0">Adakah itu yang anda mahukan? Jika dia menolak, kita semua akan mati.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1162" begin="31007232506t" end="31020989999t" region="region37" style="style0">Terlalu berbahaya untuk menyeberangi dataran.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1163" begin="31031417500t" end="31044767502t" region="region39" style="style0">Kami akan menunggu kegelapan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1164" begin="31051437500t" end="31063952502t" region="region37" style="style0">Tetapi kita kesuntukan masa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1165" begin="31099827508t" end="31112750001t" region="region50" style="style0">-Saya katakan kita menyeberang sekarang. -Dan saya katakan kita tunggu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1166" begin="31099827508t" end="31112750001t" region="region37" style="style0">(ELUPAS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1167" begin="31159887508t" end="31171557500t" region="region76" style="style0">Sepanjang masa awak berjauhan, dia tak pernah lupakan awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1168" begin="31171557500t" end="31186160003t" region="region18" style="style0">Hati Hathor tau. Awak selalu masuk</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1169" begin="31186160003t" end="31206597505t" region="region33" style="style0">Ya, tetapi dia mempunyai hati yang besar.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1170" begin="31186160003t" end="31206597505t" region="region25" style="style0">Bilik yang cukup untuk orang ramai di sana.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1171" begin="31206597505t" end="31221189999t" region="region46" style="style0">Beritahu saya, oh, Tuhan Udara yang bijaksana.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1172" begin="31206597505t" end="31221189999t" region="region76" style="style0">Mengapa anda fikir Set membiarkan anda hidup?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1173" begin="31297940006t" end="31310455008t" region="region95" style="style0">Dia melakukannya kerana cinta.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1174" begin="31297940006t" end="31310455008t" region="region61" style="style0">Anda akan menghukum dia untuk itu?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1175" begin="31557782506t" end="31571539999t" region="region66" style="style0">Saya tidak mahu bantuan dia.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1176" begin="31662047500t" end="31674562502t" region="region39" style="style0">Saya hanya mahu satu perkara.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1177" begin="31702087500t" end="31721689999t" region="region17" style="style0">Saya rasa semua orang bodoh. awak tahu,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1178" begin="31702087500t" end="31721689999t" region="region5" style="style0">adalah lebih besar daripada kebanyakan. Tetapi Engkau, Tuhanku,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1179" begin="31736292503t" end="31751312508t" region="region44" style="style0">memikirkan tentang dia? HATHOR: Adakah awak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1180" begin="31776750003t" end="31791352508t" region="region1" style="style0">Sudah tentu anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1181" begin="31776750003t" end="31791352508t" region="region75" style="style0">sebagai Puan Barat. Saya pernah dikenali</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1182" begin="31855995003t" end="31879355006t" region="region28" style="style0">Kewajipan saya adalah untuk membantu roh yang mati</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1183" begin="31855995003t" end="31879355006t" region="region33" style="style0">ke alam Akhirat. buat cara mereka</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1184" begin="31879355006t" end="31892277500t" region="region37" style="style0">ke Tanah Orang Mati? Anda mengembara</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1185" begin="31892277500t" end="31907297505t" region="region21" style="style0">Malah kepada mereka yang telah meninggal dunia. Saya adalah Dewi Cinta.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1186" begin="31892277500t" end="31907297505t" region="region36" style="style0">Saya masih muda. Mudah tergoda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1187" begin="31907297505t" end="31920230007t" region="region18" style="style0">"Tergoda"?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1188" begin="31907297505t" end="31920230007t" region="region10" style="style0">syaitan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1189" begin="31920230007t" end="31934405001t" region="region3" style="style0">Ini menghalang mereka.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1190" begin="31934405001t" end="31951512508t" region="region37" style="style0">Gelang 42 Bintang.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1191" begin="31954842502t" end="31969445006t" region="region110" style="style0">Satu untuk setiap syaitan yang dibunuh Horus untuk membebaskan saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1192" begin="32061205008t" end="32075380002t" region="region25" style="style0">Masa tu aku tahu aku sayang dia.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1193" begin="32075380002t" end="32089565006t" region="region47" style="style0">awak berjuang untuk dia. Zaya perlu tahu</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1194" begin="32119177506t" end="32134605001t" region="region1" style="style0">Jadi dia tidak kehilangan harapan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1195" begin="32154625001t" end="32181742508t" region="region21" style="style0">(BISIK) Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1196" begin="32154625001t" end="32181742508t" region="region1" style="style0">Ia akan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1197" begin="32181742508t" end="32193412500t" region="region25" style="style0">Bolehkah anda mendengar saya? Zaya? Zaya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1198" begin="32198840006t" end="32212179999t" region="region47" style="style0">Adakah ia?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1199" begin="32224277501t" end="32239715006t" region="region13" style="style0">Siapakah itu?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1200" begin="32315620002t" end="32329805006t" region="region76" style="style0">Siapa di sana?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1201" begin="32369427506t" end="32385272502t" region="region40" style="style0">Hathor, Puan Perempuan Barat. ZAYA: Cikgu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1202" begin="32407380003t" end="32419477506t" region="region42" style="style0">dari Tanah Kehidupan. Saya bercakap dengan awak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1203" begin="32439080006t" end="32452419999t" region="region5" style="style0">Kekasih awak ada bersama saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1204" begin="32493295000t" end="32510402507t" region="region66" style="style0">Zaya, ini saya. Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1205" begin="32532917500t" end="32542927500t" region="region1" style="style0">Saya tahu jika ada cara, anda akan menemuinya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1206" begin="32532917500t" end="32542927500t" region="region75" style="style0">Tetapi saya tidak dapat melihat awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1207" begin="32542927500t" end="32563365000t" region="region18" style="style0">kita boleh bersama lagi. BEK: Dengar,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1208" begin="32563365000t" end="32588812506t" region="region13" style="style0">awak boleh balik.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1209" begin="32563365000t" end="32588812506t" region="region98" style="style0">Tetapi bagaimana?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1210" begin="32563365000t" end="32588812506t" region="region38" style="style0">Saya menolong Horus.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1211" begin="32588812506t" end="32602987500t" region="region3" style="style0">dia akan menolong kita. Sebagai balasan,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1212" begin="32588812506t" end="32602987500t" region="region38" style="style0">ZAYA: Bek yang saya sayang?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1213" begin="32602987500t" end="32623007500t" region="region36" style="style0">Saya tahu, Zaya. Saya sendiri sukar mempercayainya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1214" begin="32623007500t" end="32634687501t" region="region111" style="style0">(KECAK) Bek, saya, mempercayai tuhan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1215" begin="32623007500t" end="32634687501t" region="region5" style="style0">Tapi saya silap, Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1216" begin="32634687501t" end="32652212508t" region="region13" style="style0">seperti yang anda katakan dia akan menjadi. Horus adalah tuhan yang adil,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1217" begin="32634687501t" end="32652212508t" region="region46" style="style0">"Saya dah beritahu awak," sekarang. Anda mungkin berfikir,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1218" begin="32652212508t" end="32665135001t" region="region65" style="style0">Nah, ya. Sedikit sahaja. (KETAWA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1219" begin="32691835008t" end="32703922500t" region="region42" style="style0">untuk mendengar suara anda. Ia sangat baik</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1220" begin="32709767506t" end="32722689999t" region="region11" style="style0">baik-baik, Zaya, percayalah. BEK: Semuanya berjalan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1221" begin="32726865003t" end="32747302503t" region="region36" style="style0">untuk membawa awak balik. Horus akan pergi</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1222" begin="32747302503t" end="32763982500t" region="region51" style="style0">Saya tahu dia akan melakukannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1223" begin="32747302503t" end="32763982500t" region="region89" style="style0">pertahanan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1224" begin="32763982500t" end="32780255006t" region="region36" style="style0">Bek, awak ada ke?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1225" begin="32763982500t" end="32780255006t" region="region38" style="style0">(KAKITANGAN BERKEKUT) (TERGAS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1226" begin="32903287500t" end="32929987506t" region="region111" style="style0">Dilarang orang mati bercakap dengan orang hidup.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1227" begin="32903287500t" end="32929987506t" region="region1" style="style0">Pergi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1228" begin="32929987506t" end="32953337500t" region="region42" style="style0">Ada roda di dalam.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1229" begin="32953337500t" end="32982542508t" region="region33" style="style0">pasir berhenti bergerak. Apabila anda memutarnya,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1230" begin="32953337500t" end="32982542508t" region="region39" style="style0">untuk pergi melalui pintu. Kami cuma perlukan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1231" begin="32982542508t" end="33003387500t" region="region21" style="style0">Nasib baik awak nampak rancangan tu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1232" begin="32982542508t" end="33003387500t" region="region39" style="style0">HORUS: Jika anda tidak tahu yang mana satu itu,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1233" begin="33003387500t" end="33015902502t" region="region65" style="style0">ini benar-benar mustahil.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1234" begin="33030087506t" end="33043427500t" region="region36" style="style0">-Bek? -Ya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1235" begin="33053437500t" end="33079302506t" region="region18" style="style0">yang mana pintu, kan? Awak tahu</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1236" begin="33053437500t" end="33079302506t" region="region51" style="style0">Ya, sudah tentu, ia...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1237" begin="33079302506t" end="33103487500t" region="region38" style="style0">yang ini.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1238" begin="33079302506t" end="33103487500t" region="region30" style="style0">Tidak, tidak, itu... Yang itu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1239" begin="33103487500t" end="33119760006t" region="region36" style="style0">Tidak, tidak, yang ini!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1240" begin="33103487500t" end="33119760006t" region="region63" style="style0">Gulung tulang.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1241" begin="33119760006t" end="33131440007t" region="region42" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1242" begin="33131440007t" end="33143527500t" region="region21" style="style0">(JERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1243" begin="33131440007t" end="33143527500t" region="region5" style="style0">(JERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1244" begin="33143527500t" end="33156877502t" region="region3" style="style0">(DEPAN BERIRAMA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1245" begin="33162722508t" end="33186072502t" region="region42" style="style0">(KECEWA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1246" begin="33162722508t" end="33186072502t" region="region63" style="style0">THOTH: Anda rasa?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1247" begin="33186072502t" end="33205675001t" region="region1" style="style0">(Tergagap) Nah...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1248" begin="33205675001t" end="33222782508t" region="region71" style="style0">Saya mendapati pergantungan anda pada peluang merisaukan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1249" begin="33205675001t" end="33222782508t" region="region55" style="style0">Jika anda terus bertahan,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1250" begin="33236540002t" end="33251977508t" region="region39" style="style0">Saya mungkin perlu mengkaji anda lebih lanjut.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1251" begin="33251977508t" end="33270745006t" region="region65" style="style0">jalan mana ke Sphinx? sekarang,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1252" begin="33270745006t" end="33283249999t" region="region76" style="style0">Penceroboh di Rumah Raja,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1253" begin="33313697500t" end="33332892508t" region="region3" style="style0">jawab teka-teki saya atau berhenti menjadi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1254" begin="33313697500t" end="33332892508t" region="region51" style="style0">Teruskan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1255" begin="33332892508t" end="33356660002t" region="region33" style="style0">saya tunggu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1256" begin="33332892508t" end="33356660002t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1257" begin="33377932503t" end="33391282507t" region="region76" style="style0">Saya tidak pernah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1258" begin="33426312502t" end="33453837500t" region="region35" style="style0">Saya sentiasa menjadi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1259" begin="33426312502t" end="33453837500t" region="region53" style="style0">Tiada siapa yang pernah melihat saya, dan tidak akan pernah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1260" begin="33453837500t" end="33468857505t" region="region40" style="style0">Namun saya adalah keyakinan semua yang hidup dan bernafas.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1261" begin="33453837500t" end="33468857505t" region="region51" style="style0">Apa saya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1262" begin="33499722506t" end="33518907505t" region="region18" style="style0">Pesanan. Anda Pesanan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1263" begin="33582307508t" end="33594812500t" region="region56" style="style0">Saya tidak pernah meragui awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1264" begin="33634017500t" end="33660717506t" region="region3" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1265" begin="33634017500t" end="33660717506t" region="region52" style="style0">tak betul.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1266" begin="33660717506t" end="33673639999t" region="region30" style="style0">Cuba lagi. Tolonglah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1267" begin="33794177500t" end="33816285001t" region="region32" style="style0">Itu adalah jawapan yang betul-betul sesuai.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1268" begin="33794177500t" end="33816285001t" region="region40" style="style0">(MENGERAM)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1269" begin="33828382503t" end="33858830003t" region="region3" style="style0">Anda adalah Kesucian.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1270" begin="33828382503t" end="33858830003t" region="region10" style="style0">(Merengus) (MEMERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1271" begin="33858830003t" end="33874257500t" region="region40" style="style0">(TERGAS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1272" begin="33874257500t" end="33894277500t" region="region27" style="style0">silap lagi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1273" begin="33894277500t" end="33918472503t" region="region51" style="style0">"Apa yang tidak pernah berlaku." (GAGAP)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1274" begin="33894277500t" end="33918472503t" region="region59" style="style0">"Sentiasa menjadi."</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1275" begin="33918472503t" end="33944327500t" region="region32" style="style0">Pada masa hadapan. Tidak wujud. khayalan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1276" begin="33918472503t" end="33944327500t" region="region13" style="style0">(MERENGANG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1277" begin="33944327500t" end="33958930003t" region="region30" style="style0">(Merengus) Namun...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1278" begin="33958930003t" end="33973939999t" region="region10" style="style0">THOTH: Namun ia wujud dan "tidak pernah ada."</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1279" begin="33958930003t" end="33973939999t" region="region36" style="style0">(MENEGANG) Thoth... "Sentiasa menjadi."</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1280" begin="33998552503t" end="34012320007t" region="region42" style="style0">semua yang hidup dan bernafas. Namun saya adalah keyakinan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1281" begin="33998552503t" end="34012320007t" region="region62" style="style0">Manusia hidup dan bernafas!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1282" begin="34012320007t" end="34027330002t" region="region53" style="style0">Mungkin berhenti berfikir seperti tuhan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1283" begin="34027330002t" end="34046515001t" region="region40" style="style0">Kemudian saya mungkin juga berhenti berfikir.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1284" begin="34027330002t" end="34046515001t" region="region51" style="style0">Thoth!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1285" begin="34046515001t" end="34065282500t" region="region41" style="style0">Tunggu, tunggu, saya ada!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1286" begin="34046515001t" end="34065282500t" region="region89" style="style0">Anda adalah Esok.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1287" begin="34065282500t" end="34081972507t" region="region41" style="style0">Oh, mengganggu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1288" begin="34065282500t" end="34081972507t" region="region99" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1289" begin="34091147506t" end="34105322500t" region="region58" style="style0">(SPHINX MENGERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1290" begin="34105322500t" end="34128265003t" region="region44" style="style0">HORUS: Satu titis.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1291" begin="34105322500t" end="34128265003t" region="region17" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1292" begin="34128265003t" end="34141197506t" region="region30" style="style0">Tidak!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1293" begin="34148285003t" end="34174139999t" region="region23" style="style0">(SUARA BERGEMA DAN MErungut)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1294" begin="34148285003t" end="34174139999t" region="region64" style="style0">(MENGERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1295" begin="34186237501t" end="34212102507t" region="region56" style="style0">Saya patut terima kasih.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1296" begin="34186237501t" end="34212102507t" region="region38" style="style0">Anda menarik dia dari perpustakaannya supaya saya tidak perlu melakukannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1297" begin="34217102502t" end="34234617500t" region="region30" style="style0">Bahagian akhir.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1298" begin="34234617500t" end="34264229999t" region="region41" style="style0">awak pengecut.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1299" begin="34234617500t" end="34264229999t" region="region55" style="style0">Buka pintu gerbang ini dan lawan saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1300" begin="34276745001t" end="34289260003t" region="region66" style="style0">sekali lagi?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1301" begin="34289260003t" end="34307610002t" region="region39" style="style0">Tidakkah dia sudah cukup melihat awak kalah?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1302" begin="34307610002t" end="34344309999t" region="region19" style="style0">Tidak bolehkah awak benarkan saya melepaskan awak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1303" begin="34307610002t" end="34344309999t" region="region23" style="style0">satu saat terakhir yang memalukan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1304" begin="34356407501t" end="34373932508t" region="region61" style="style0">sebelum anda mati?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1305" begin="34451090006t" end="34463187508t" region="region42" style="style0">Berhenti!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1306" begin="34476527501t" end="34493635008t" region="region76" style="style0">Kenali ini?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1307" begin="34552860007t" end="34564947500t" region="region1" style="style0">Adakah dia memberitahu anda bahawa dia boleh membawa wanita anda kembali dari kematian?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1308" begin="34626677501t" end="34644610000t" region="region18" style="style0">Ia tidak mungkin.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1309" begin="34626677501t" end="34644610000t" region="region46" style="style0">Bukan untuk saya pun.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1310" begin="34681737506t" end="34694660000t" region="region45" style="style0">Awak harap saya percaya awak?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1311" begin="34681737506t" end="34694660000t" region="region38" style="style0">Saya tidak perlu berbohong.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1312" begin="34681737506t" end="34694660000t" region="region66" style="style0">Bagaimana lagi tuhan yang buta dan tidak berguna</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1313" begin="34711767506t" end="34724690000t" region="region25" style="style0">minta awak tolong dia?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1314" begin="34730952506t" end="34744302508t" region="region66" style="style0">Teruskan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1315" begin="34765147500t" end="34789342503t" region="region54" style="style0">Tanya dia.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1316" begin="34765147500t" end="34789342503t" region="region36" style="style0">-Tuangkan ke dalamnya. -Adakah ia benar?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1317" begin="34789342503t" end="34804362508t" region="region18" style="style0">Bek, tuangkan!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1318" begin="34811867506t" end="34824382508t" region="region27" style="style0">Tidak!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1319" begin="34844402508t" end="34857325001t" region="region10" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1320" begin="34844402508t" end="34857325001t" region="region59" style="style0">Malu awak tidak berada di sisi saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1321" begin="34857325001t" end="34869422503t" region="region1" style="style0">itu tidak membiarkan kematian menghalangnya. Saya mengagumi seseorang</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1322" begin="34869422503t" end="34883607508t" region="region76" style="style0">Tetapi ini adalah apa yang cinta mendapat anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1323" begin="34897782502t" end="34914880000t" region="region30" style="style0">Agak sesuai untuk anda berdua</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1324" begin="34919890003t" end="34934900000t" region="region65" style="style0">mati bersama di sini di rumah saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1325" begin="34945327500t" end="34959512503t" region="region3" style="style0">Saya akan merindui perbualan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1326" begin="34975357500t" end="34987872502t" region="region27" style="style0">Dan selebihnya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1327" begin="34995377500t" end="35012902507t" region="region13" style="style0">(TERGAS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1328" begin="35043767508t" end="35055437500t" region="region44" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1329" begin="35043767508t" end="35055437500t" region="region21" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1330" begin="35055437500t" end="35068370002t" region="region40" style="style0">(HORUS mendengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1331" begin="35169722503t" end="35204762508t" region="region54" style="style0">(BATUK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1332" begin="35169722503t" end="35204762508t" region="region3" style="style0">(Hembus nafas berat)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1333" begin="35215597500t" end="35228947502t" region="region51" style="style0">Awak menolak dendam saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1334" begin="35215597500t" end="35228947502t" region="region64" style="style0">(TERHANGAT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1335" begin="35256055000t" end="35273162507t" region="region21" style="style0">Zaya fikir awak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1336" begin="35256055000t" end="35273162507t" region="region30" style="style0">perkara yang paling hebat dalam semua ciptaan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1337" begin="35292347506t" end="35304862508t" region="region5" style="style0">Setiap hari, dia berdoa untuk kamu menyelamatkan Mesir,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1338" begin="35304862508t" end="35316950001t" region="region25" style="style0">tapi awak tak datang.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1339" begin="35360330003t" end="35374097508t" region="region36" style="style0">Saya berada di dalam kubur. saya tak dengar.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1340" begin="35374097508t" end="35385350000t" region="region56" style="style0">Tidak, anda tidak mendengar.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1341" begin="35395777500t" end="35414555008t" region="region21" style="style0">adakah dendam bodoh awak. Semua yang anda ambil berat</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1342" begin="35395777500t" end="35414555008t" region="region36" style="style0">Saya salah tentang awak. Saya mula berfikir</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1343" begin="35497965001t" end="35514655008t" region="region76" style="style0">Tetapi saya akhirnya mendapat pengajaran daripada tuhan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1344" begin="35514655008t" end="35528830002t" region="region40" style="style0">Kami tidak penting bagi anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1345" begin="35528830002t" end="35545927500t" region="region54" style="style0">Nah, sekarang anda tahu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1346" begin="35528830002t" end="35545927500t" region="region39" style="style0">Anubis, keluar.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1347" begin="35553025006t" end="35572627506t" region="region61" style="style0">(SANGKUT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1348" begin="35646027500t" end="35665630000t" region="region42" style="style0">perempuan simpanan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1349" begin="35734875008t" end="35747380001t" region="region40" style="style0">seindah subuh pertama. Anda masih</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1350" begin="35870840003t" end="35895452508t" region="region40" style="style0">Hathor, apa yang awak buat?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1351" begin="35870840003t" end="35895452508t" region="region51" style="style0">Kekasih manusia ini tidak membawa harta untuk timbangan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1352" begin="35870840003t" end="35895452508t" region="region112" style="style0">Mungkin kita boleh tolong dia.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1353" begin="35906705000t" end="35923812507t" region="region11" style="style0">Anda bertanya banyak, Puan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1354" begin="35937987501t" end="35959260002t" region="region4" style="style0">Ia sememangnya memerlukan harta yang sangat istimewa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1355" begin="35937987501t" end="35959260002t" region="region27" style="style0">Tidak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1356" begin="36134857508t" end="36146110000t" region="region30" style="style0">-Macam ini? -Tidak. Tidak!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1357" begin="36156537500t" end="36183655006t" region="region113" style="style0">Puan Barat? untuk awak,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1358" begin="36156537500t" end="36183655006t" region="region39" style="style0">ya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1359" begin="36183655006t" end="36201170003t" region="region3" style="style0">untuk memberikannya sendiri. Berikan dia laluan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1360" begin="36183655006t" end="36201170003t" region="region67" style="style0">Anda akan melihatnya buat kali terakhir.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1361" begin="36201170003t" end="36216180000t" region="region33" style="style0">terima kasih.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1362" begin="36201170003t" end="36216180000t" region="region36" style="style0">Tidak, tidak, saya melarangnya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1363" begin="36236617500t" end="36253307506t" region="region51" style="style0">Kami berdua bersalah kerana menipu Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1364" begin="36236617500t" end="36253307506t" region="region59" style="style0">Ini akan membuat perubahan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1365" begin="36285842508t" end="36301270003t" region="region42" style="style0">Bukan macam ni. Bukan dengan awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1366" begin="36285842508t" end="36301270003t" region="region50" style="style0">Saya perintahkan awak lepaskan saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1367" begin="36317532500t" end="36337552500t" region="region41" style="style0">Awak tak boleh perintah saya. Anda tahu mengapa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1368" begin="36317532500t" end="36337552500t" region="region55" style="style0">Saya adalah Dewi Cinta.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1369" begin="36366747500t" end="36393865006t" region="region21" style="style0">Jika saya tidak melakukan ini, saya bukan apa-apa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1370" begin="36366747500t" end="36393865006t" region="region36" style="style0">Saya tidak boleh kehilangan awak lagi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1371" begin="36393865006t" end="36408457501t" region="region28" style="style0">(MENGERUNG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1372" begin="36408457501t" end="36425565008t" region="region3" style="style0">Ambillah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1373" begin="36425565008t" end="36451002503t" region="region44" style="style0">Lakukan apa yang perlu anda lakukan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1374" begin="36425565008t" end="36451002503t" region="region46" style="style0">Dewan Dua Kebenaran.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1375" begin="36465187508t" end="36480197502t" region="region10" style="style0">Di mana kita akan dihakimi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1376" begin="36465187508t" end="36480197502t" region="region39" style="style0">KETUA HAKIM: Melangkah ke hadapan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1377" begin="36506062508t" end="36518150001t" region="region30" style="style0">Apa yang anda tawarkan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1378" begin="36537335000t" end="36553607506t" region="region37" style="style0">(KLIK SKALA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1379" begin="36553607506t" end="36577792500t" region="region40" style="style0">Langkah ke hadapan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1380" begin="36553607506t" end="36577792500t" region="region62" style="style0">Saya akan hidup selama-lamanya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1381" begin="36596152508t" end="36632017505t" region="region41" style="style0">KETUA HAKIM: Apa yang anda tawarkan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1382" begin="36596152508t" end="36632017505t" region="region27" style="style0">(KLIK SKALA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1383" begin="36647027500t" end="36661630003t" region="region1" style="style0">Langkah ke hadapan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1384" begin="36661630003t" end="36676232508t" region="region36" style="style0">(MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1385" begin="36697912500t" end="36716680000t" region="region13" style="style0">Langkah ke hadapan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1386" begin="36697912500t" end="36716680000t" region="region43" style="style0">Apa yang anda tawarkan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1387" begin="36733787506t" end="36750885003t" region="region28" style="style0">Apa yang anda tawarkan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1388" begin="36750885003t" end="36765487508t" region="region1" style="style0">Ia akan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1389" begin="36776332508t" end="36789255001t" region="region44" style="style0">(TERKECAK LEMBUT) Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1390" begin="36798847501t" end="36826382508t" region="region37" style="style0">(SET MENGERUM)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1391" begin="36826382508t" end="36840557502t" region="region44" style="style0">HAMBA: Set,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1392" begin="36826382508t" end="36840557502t" region="region38" style="style0">menerima sayap emas Nephthys.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1393" begin="36857237500t" end="36887267500t" region="region43" style="style0">daripada mereka yang akan membahayakan. Semoga mereka melindunginya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1394" begin="36857237500t" end="36887267500t" region="region36" style="style0">(Berdenting)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1395" begin="36887267500t" end="36907705000t" region="region103" style="style0">HAMBA: The karr of Thoth, Tuhan Kebijaksanaan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1396" begin="36887267500t" end="36907705000t" region="region55" style="style0">Benarkan dia pengetahuan lama.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1397" begin="36887267500t" end="36907705000t" region="region88" style="style0">(ELEKTRIK KERETAK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1398" begin="36907705000t" end="36927307500t" region="region30" style="style0">Hati Osiris.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1399" begin="36907705000t" end="36927307500t" region="region75" style="style0">Berikan dia kuasa atas semua Tanah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1400" begin="36927307500t" end="36946910000t" region="region38" style="style0">Mata yang melihat segala-galanya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1401" begin="36927307500t" end="36946910000t" region="region39" style="style0">Beri ganjaran kepadanya supaya tiada musuh yang boleh menipu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1402" begin="36927307500t" end="36946910000t" region="region114" style="style0">(MENGERAM)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1403" begin="37011562503t" end="37026165008t" region="region30" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1404" begin="37111245003t" end="37125430007t" region="region25" style="style0">Engkau kelihatan mulia, Tuhan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1405" begin="37125430007t" end="37137100000t" region="region76" style="style0">saya tahu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1406" begin="37145867508t" end="37157120000t" region="region76" style="style0">SET: Bapa...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1407" begin="37162130003t" end="37181732503t" region="region115" style="style0">Saya perhatikan menara itu. Mengagumkan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1408" begin="37181732503t" end="37193412506t" region="region25" style="style0">Saya membinanya untuk awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1409" begin="37193412506t" end="37207170000t" region="region76" style="style0">Jika ia lebih tinggi, ia akan menghalang saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1410" begin="37326465008t" end="37338552500t" region="region36" style="style0">Alihkan mata anda dari layar anda</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1411" begin="37346485008t" end="37358572500t" region="region5" style="style0">dan lihat semua yang saya lakukan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1412" begin="37452837505t" end="37472857505t" region="region38" style="style0">Apa yang Osiris tidak pernah dapat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1413" begin="37452837505t" end="37472857505t" region="region116" style="style0">Saya memerintah semua yang bernafas.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1414" begin="37452837505t" end="37472857505t" region="region47" style="style0">Dan semua yang dihembuskan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1415" begin="37472857505t" end="37493712506t" region="region18" style="style0">Tiada yang lebih kuat di bawah matahari.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1416" begin="37472857505t" end="37493712506t" region="region32" style="style0">kerana saya telah menghormati anda. Kemudian muliakan saya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1417" begin="37493712506t" end="37512897505t" region="region51" style="style0">Jika kehormatan adalah niatmu,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1418" begin="37493712506t" end="37512897505t" region="region117" style="style0">daripada membunuh saudaramu. anda mungkin telah berpantang</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1419" begin="37493712506t" end="37512897505t" region="region5" style="style0">segalanya di bawah sana. Jadi anda nampak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1420" begin="37512897505t" end="37524995006t" region="region40" style="style0">adakah anda peduli apa yang berlaku? Beritahu saya, Bapa,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1421" begin="37524995006t" end="37546685008t" region="region53" style="style0">Saya mengambil berat lebih daripada yang anda tahu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1422" begin="37546685008t" end="37567947500t" region="region0" style="style0">Saya membuang seorang diri Kemudian mengapa</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1423" begin="37546685008t" end="37567947500t" region="region40" style="style0">berjalan di atas pasir yang terbakar (BERBISIK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1424" begin="37546685008t" end="37567947500t" region="region118" style="style0">manakala abang saya bermain berkaki ayam</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1425" begin="37567947500t" end="37582132503t" region="region13" style="style0">di tepi sungai Nil?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1426" begin="37567947500t" end="37582132503t" region="region10" style="style0">Kenapa awak jadikan Osiris King?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1427" begin="37670552502t" end="37686407508t" region="region36" style="style0">Dan mengapa kamu memberinya seorang anak lelaki?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1428" begin="37716437508t" end="37731865003t" region="region43" style="style0">peluang untuk memberi kehidupan. Namun anda menafikan saya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1429" begin="37716437508t" end="37731865003t" region="region76" style="style0">Ini adalah ujian anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1430" begin="37731865003t" end="37746467508t" region="region61" style="style0">Awak tak uji dia.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1431" begin="37784002506t" end="37797760000t" region="region76" style="style0">mahkota Mesir. Saya memberi Osiris</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1432" begin="37837392508t" end="37849480001t" region="region61" style="style0">dia tidak berpegang pada kuasanya. Dan apabila tiba masanya,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1433" begin="37934570006t" end="37947910000t" region="region37" style="style0">Dia memberikannya secara percuma. Dia lulus ujiannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1434" begin="38014650006t" end="38027990000t" region="region1" style="style0">Saya telah melepasi saya. Dan saya akan bertaruh</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1435" begin="38077215008t" end="38099312500t" region="region43" style="style0">belum lagi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1436" begin="38077215008t" end="38099312500t" region="region36" style="style0">memang betul...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1437" begin="38099312500t" end="38128507500t" region="region27" style="style0">Saya tidak mahu anda mempunyai anak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1438" begin="38099312500t" end="38128507500t" region="region0" style="style0">Ini adalah kebaikan,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1439" begin="38128507500t" end="38143110003t" region="region71" style="style0">kerana saya tidak mahu awak merindui mereka</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1440" begin="38128507500t" end="38143110003t" region="region89" style="style0">seteruk yang saya ada.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1441" begin="38143110003t" end="38157295008t" region="region18" style="style0">Rindu mereka?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1442" begin="38143110003t" end="38157295008t" region="region0" style="style0">untuk mengambil tempat saya. saya perlukan awak</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1443" begin="38157295008t" end="38171052502t" region="region3" style="style0">Di sini?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1444" begin="38157295008t" end="38171052502t" region="region95" style="style0">ujian berakhir, anakku. Beginilah cara anda</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1445" begin="38171052502t" end="38186072507t" region="region5" style="style0">Tidak ada beban yang lebih besar.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1446" begin="38171052502t" end="38186072507t" region="region106" style="style0">Tetapi tiada penghormatan yang lebih besar.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1447" begin="38205675006t" end="38218180000t" region="region66" style="style0">Semua yang telah anda lakukan boleh dimaafkan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1448" begin="38242792503t" end="38257395008t" region="region36" style="style0">Anda mengharapkan saya untuk bertanding dengan binatang ini</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1449" begin="38310357501t" end="38327465008t" region="region66" style="style0">malam demi malam sehingga saya mati?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1450" begin="38381262502t" end="38395865006t" region="region5" style="style0">apa yang awak nak?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1451" begin="38438817500t" end="38456342507t" region="region3" style="style0">Keabadian.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1452" begin="38438817500t" end="38456342507t" region="region62" style="style0">Keabadian menanti kita semua di Akhirat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1453" begin="38498877500t" end="38511392502t" region="region66" style="style0">Saya tidak mahu mati. Saya mahu hidup.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1454" begin="38530995001t" end="38543927505t" region="region66" style="style0">Selamanya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1455" begin="38548102508t" end="38560190001t" region="region61" style="style0">di negeri yang aku takluki. Di bawah sana</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1456" begin="38572705003t" end="38586472507t" region="region37" style="style0">kerajaan saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1457" begin="38618997500t" end="38636105006t" region="region2" style="style0">Ini sepatutnya menjadi ganjaran saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1458" begin="38618997500t" end="38636105006t" region="region17" style="style0">Bagaimana? Satu-satunya cara untuk mencapai ini tidak dapat difikirkan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1459" begin="38642775003t" end="38657377508t" region="region37" style="style0">Seseorang perlu memakan...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1460" begin="38694912506t" end="38708670000t" region="region30" style="style0">Akhirat itu sendiri.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1461" begin="38711175001t" end="38725777506t" region="region1" style="style0">Anda akan melepaskan Huru-hara semasa penciptaan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1462" begin="38771652502t" end="38786255006t" region="region25" style="style0">Anda akan memusnahkan segala-galanya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1463" begin="38839217500t" end="38853402503t" region="region3" style="style0">Bukan memusnahkan. Bentuk semula.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1464" begin="38867170007t" end="38879257500t" region="region30" style="style0">Saya akan ambil tempat awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1465" begin="39059855000t" end="39075710006t" region="region11" style="style0">Tetapi ia tidak akan duduk di atas bot sialan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1466" begin="39081127501t" end="39100730001t" region="region27" style="style0">(SET PERNAFASAN BERAT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1467" begin="39081127501t" end="39100730001t" region="region88" style="style0">tahan itu. Tiada tuhan boleh</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1468" begin="39133682503t" end="39149527500t" region="region61" style="style0">Saya bukan hanya satu tuhan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1469" begin="39149527500t" end="39184985005t" region="region56" style="style0">(TERGAS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1470" begin="39149527500t" end="39184985005t" region="region88" style="style0">KETUA HAKIM: Apa yang anda tawarkan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1471" begin="39197917508t" end="39213345003t" region="region61" style="style0">tempat di akhirat. Ini akan membeli anda</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1472" begin="39213345003t" end="39227947508t" region="region61" style="style0">ZAYA: Tidak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1473" begin="39259637500t" end="39280910001t" region="region33" style="style0">Bukan tanpa awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1474" begin="39259637500t" end="39280910001t" region="region76" style="style0">(GEMPAR)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1475" begin="39293425003t" end="39307192507t" region="region1" style="style0">(JIWA MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1476" begin="39335552506t" end="39348067508t" region="region44" style="style0">Pintu pagar telah rosak!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1477" begin="39356825006t" end="39384767505t" region="region3" style="style0">Kekacauan merebak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1478" begin="39399777500t" end="39436905006t" region="region17" style="style0">musnahkan tanah ini. Apophis hendaklah</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1479" begin="39399777500t" end="39436905006t" region="region30" style="style0">(APOPHIS MENGERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1480" begin="39436905006t" end="39457760007t" region="region37" style="style0">hanya harapan sekarang. Horus adalah kami</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1481" begin="39457760007t" end="39469847500t" region="region25" style="style0">anda fikir dia, Zaya. Dia bukan tuhan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1482" begin="39521567501t" end="39538675008t" region="region76" style="style0">Dia tipu saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1483" begin="39551597501t" end="39569122508t" region="region61" style="style0">Beri dia peluang lagi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1484" begin="39577045006t" end="39589967500t" region="region40" style="style0">Dia hanya sampai sejauh ini kerana awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1485" begin="39634600003t" end="39647115006t" region="region36" style="style0">Kekuatan saya tidak terhingga.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1486" begin="39634600003t" end="39647115006t" region="region88" style="style0">mempunyai apa-apa rancangan untuk membetulkan perkara ini, If the Lord of the Air</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1487" begin="39740117500t" end="39759312508t" region="region44" style="style0">dia harus berbuat demikian dengan tergesa-gesa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1488" begin="39759312508t" end="39775992506t" region="region33" style="style0">Kalau awak tak percaya dia, percayalah saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1489" begin="39759312508t" end="39775992506t" region="region3" style="style0">Saya tahu kita akan bersama lagi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1490" begin="39775992506t" end="39790167500t" region="region26" style="style0">HORUS: Ra telah jatuh.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1491" begin="39775992506t" end="39790167500t" region="region13" style="style0">Set telah melancarkan Chaos.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1492" begin="39790167500t" end="39800177500t" region="region44" style="style0">Jadi bagaimana kita menghalangnya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1493" begin="39790167500t" end="39800177500t" region="region46" style="style0">Anda tidak pernah berputus asa, bukan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1494" begin="39800177500t" end="39820197500t" region="region27" style="style0">Zaya suruh aku jangan. Hanya kerana</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1495" begin="39820197500t" end="39844810003t" region="region53" style="style0">tentang tawaran kami? Awak tak beritahu dia</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1496" begin="39820197500t" end="39844810003t" region="region97" style="style0">Ya, saya memberitahunya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1497" begin="39844810003t" end="39863160002t" region="region21" style="style0">dia masih percaya pada awak. Tetapi atas sebab tertentu,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1498" begin="39844810003t" end="39863160002t" region="region1" style="style0">Kita mesti kembali ke ibu kota.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1499" begin="39863160002t" end="39889025008t" region="region23" style="style0">Kemudian kita perlu berjalan jauh di hadapan kita.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1500" begin="39863160002t" end="39889025008t" region="region3" style="style0">(BURUNG BERKICANG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1501" begin="39889025008t" end="39910287500t" region="region42" style="style0">Saya lebih suka terbang.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1502" begin="39910287500t" end="39927395006t" region="region0" style="style0">Nephthys.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1503" begin="39910287500t" end="39927395006t" region="region39" style="style0">dia cuba membantu kita. Walaupun selepas kematian,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1504" begin="39927395006t" end="39940317500t" region="region17" style="style0">(GURUH GEMPAR)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1505" begin="39927395006t" end="39940317500t" region="region5" style="style0">Datang, syaitan!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1506" begin="39940317500t" end="39954920003t" region="region40" style="style0">(MENGERAM)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1507" begin="39940317500t" end="39954920003t" region="region88" style="style0">HORUS: Set mempunyai lembing Ra.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1508" begin="39963260002t" end="39980775000t" region="region11" style="style0">Dia menarik Apophis ke Sungai Nil,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1509" begin="39980775000t" end="40000377500t" region="region32" style="style0">kepada sumber segala kehidupan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1510" begin="39980775000t" end="40000377500t" region="region42" style="style0">kenapa?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1511" begin="40000377500t" end="40014145003t" region="region2" style="style0">Untuk memusnahkan semua ciptaan. Untuk meminumnya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1512" begin="40000377500t" end="40014145003t" region="region33" style="style0">Ra belum mati. Dan hanya dia yang boleh membetulkannya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1513" begin="40014145003t" end="40034165003t" region="region61" style="style0">Tetapi dia memerlukan lembingnya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1514" begin="40034165003t" end="40055437505t" region="region44" style="style0">Jadi bagaimana kita mendapatkannya kembali?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1515" begin="40034165003t" end="40055437505t" region="region10" style="style0">Mungkin sudah tiba masanya kita pergi memancing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1516" begin="40055437505t" end="40080457500t" region="region4" style="style0">(URSHU SOLAT SECARA TAK SENTIASA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1517" begin="40055437505t" end="40080457500t" region="region39" style="style0">Saya datang dalam perkhidmatan anda, saya meminta bantuan anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1518" begin="40080457500t" end="40096730006t" region="region44" style="style0">HORUS: Pembina. (TERGAS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1519" begin="40080457500t" end="40096730006t" region="region17" style="style0">Kami memerlukan anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1520" begin="40096730006t" end="40109245008t" region="region44" style="style0">(GEMPAR)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1521" begin="40096730006t" end="40109245008t" region="region17" style="style0">(ASKAR MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1522" begin="40109245008t" end="40123002502t" region="region36" style="style0">Ia adalah satu-satunya pencapaian seni bina terbesar</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1523" begin="40109245008t" end="40123002502t" region="region88" style="style0">dan akan menjadi. yang pernah ada</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1524" begin="40130507500t" end="40152615001t" region="region71" style="style0">saya...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1525" begin="40130507500t" end="40152615001t" region="region40" style="style0">Obelisk Lord Set yang saya maksudkan,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1526" begin="40152615001t" end="40174722503t" region="region58" style="style0">2,220 hasta tinggi. berdiri dengan tepat</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1527" begin="40152615001t" end="40174722503t" region="region68" style="style0">Dan bukan sebatang batang.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1528" begin="40152615001t" end="40174722503t" region="region51" style="style0">Dibina daripada tujuh bilion blok granit,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1529" begin="40174722503t" end="40189742508t" region="region61" style="style0">lima bilion papak batu kapur Tura,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1530" begin="40300677500t" end="40313610002t" region="region10" style="style0">dan sembilan bilion talenta emas.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1531" begin="40300677500t" end="40313610002t" region="region25" style="style0">daripada berapa ramai hamba? Dan nyawa</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1532" begin="40334882503t" end="40354485003t" region="region44" style="style0">5,930.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1533" begin="40334882503t" end="40354485003t" region="region75" style="style0">Tidak, tunggu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1534" begin="40354485003t" end="40367000006t" region="region40" style="style0">Jadikan itu 5,931.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1535" begin="40354485003t" end="40367000006t" region="region88" style="style0">jangan! Anda memerlukan dia untuk pergi ke bumbung.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1536" begin="40367000006t" end="40382427501t" region="region28" style="style0">HORUS: Saya akan jumpa awak di atas.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1537" begin="40382427501t" end="40400777500t" region="region23" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1538" begin="40382427501t" end="40400777500t" region="region25" style="style0">seolah-olah dia kawan awak. Awak berdiri di sebelah dia</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1539" begin="40400777500t" end="40423720002t" region="region27" style="style0">bagaimana rasanya. Oh, saya tahu</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1540" begin="40423720002t" end="40440817500t" region="region30" style="style0">Nikmat tuhan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1541" begin="40440817500t" end="40467100006t" region="region10" style="style0">Ia memabukkan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1542" begin="40440817500t" end="40467100006t" region="region89" style="style0">salah nak ikut. Saya minta maaf anda memilih</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1543" begin="40467100006t" end="40482945001t" region="region43" style="style0">Dia bertambah baik.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1544" begin="40467100006t" end="40482945001t" region="region30" style="style0">Wanita anda masih mati, bukan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1545" begin="40482945001t" end="40498382507t" region="region58" style="style0">Gadis yang begitu cantik. malu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1546" begin="40505887505t" end="40518820007t" region="region85" style="style0">Hmm...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1547" begin="40518820007t" end="40539675008t" region="region28" style="style0">Kulit lembut yang begitu indah.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1548" begin="40539675008t" end="40565112503t" region="region32" style="style0">(MENGERUNG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1549" begin="40539675008t" end="40565112503t" region="region44" style="style0">Kekayaan Dunia Akhirat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1550" begin="40565112503t" end="40580132508t" region="region27" style="style0">(BEK BATUK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1551" begin="40581375000t" end="40598482507t" region="region11" style="style0">Awak nampak? Saya bersedia untuk mati.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1552" begin="40620997500t" end="40643940002t" region="region52" style="style0">(KEDUA-DUA MENGERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1553" begin="40620997500t" end="40643940002t" region="region42" style="style0">(APOPHIS MENGGEMPAR)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1554" begin="40643940002t" end="40663125001t" region="region10" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1555" begin="40643940002t" end="40663125001t" region="region89" style="style0">(METALLIC RATTLE)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1556" begin="40663125001t" end="40678980007t" region="region63" style="style0">SET: Mari, Apophis!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1557" begin="40663125001t" end="40678980007t" region="region11" style="style0">(GURUH GEMPAR)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1558" begin="40678980007t" end="40689825008t" region="region44" style="style0">(MENGERUNG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1559" begin="40689825008t" end="40710262508t" region="region44" style="style0">tinggal di bawah pasir. Anda sepatutnya mempunyai</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1560" begin="40710262508t" end="40738205006t" region="region41" style="style0">membunuh untuk mahkota, saya boleh faham</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1561" begin="40710262508t" end="40738205006t" region="region99" style="style0">tetapi ini adalah kegilaan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1562" begin="40738205006t" end="40755720003t" region="region78" style="style0">awak tak faham. Sudah tentu</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1563" begin="40755720003t" end="40773652502t" region="region119" style="style0">Bagaimana anda boleh?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1564" begin="40755720003t" end="40773652502t" region="region10" style="style0">daripada anak lelaki yang disayangi. Anak kesayangan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1565" begin="40755720003t" end="40773652502t" region="region36" style="style0">(MENGERUNG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1566" begin="40773652502t" end="40790750000t" region="region38" style="style0">(BEK MENJERONG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1567" begin="40773652502t" end="40790750000t" region="region30" style="style0">(MENGKEK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1568" begin="40773652502t" end="40790750000t" region="region120" style="style0">By the way,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1569" begin="40814110002t" end="40828712507t" region="region1" style="style0">Apophis akan makan Tanah Orang Mati.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1570" begin="40841217500t" end="40854150002t" region="region66" style="style0">Anda tidak akan pernah sampai ke Akhirat sekarang.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1571" begin="40915045003t" end="40934230002t" region="region37" style="style0">(TEREKUT) Apa?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1572" begin="40934230002t" end="40957590006t" region="region33" style="style0">(JERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1573" begin="40934230002t" end="40957590006t" region="region42" style="style0">Siapa yang salah pilih tuhan sekarang?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1574" begin="40991367500t" end="41007640006t" region="region51" style="style0">(MENGERUNG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1575" begin="40991367500t" end="41007640006t" region="region55" style="style0">(KEDUA-DUA MENDERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1576" begin="41007640006t" end="41037670006t" region="region3" style="style0">Saya fikir saya mungkin sebenarnya merindui pertemuan kecil kami.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1577" begin="41007640006t" end="41037670006t" region="region83" style="style0">(MENGERUNG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1578" begin="41037670006t" end="41079797508t" region="region51" style="style0">Tetapi awak masih tiada tandingan untuk saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1579" begin="41037670006t" end="41079797508t" region="region59" style="style0">awak betul.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1580" begin="41101477500t" end="41113575001t" region="region32" style="style0">Saya hanya umpan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1581" begin="41101477500t" end="41113575001t" region="region25" style="style0">Sekarang anda hanya menjadi perosak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1582" begin="41128177506t" end="41141100000t" region="region1" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1583" begin="41155702503t" end="41182392500t" region="region119" style="style0">(BEK SERU)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1584" begin="41155702503t" end="41182392500t" region="region0" style="style0">(TANAH BEK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1585" begin="41155702503t" end="41182392500t" region="region59" style="style0">(MENGERUNG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1586" begin="41182392500t" end="41202412500t" region="region67" style="style0">Horus!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1587" begin="41182392500t" end="41202412500t" region="region40" style="style0">(JERENG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1588" begin="41215762503t" end="41230365008t" region="region36" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1589" begin="41251627500t" end="41276240003t" region="region1" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1590" begin="41316697505t" end="41332125000t" region="region39" style="style0">Anda tidak fikir mata anda mungkin</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1591" begin="41416797505t" end="41441817500t" region="region17" style="style0">daripada pencuri yang cedera? lebih berguna</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1592" begin="41416797505t" end="41441817500t" region="region30" style="style0">Mungkin, ya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1593" begin="41441817500t" end="41461012508t" region="region0" style="style0">Saya minta maaf atas semua yang saya lakukan pada awak.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1594" begin="41441817500t" end="41461012508t" region="region36" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1595" begin="41461012508t" end="41482692500t" region="region40" style="style0">Termasuk ini.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1596" begin="41482692500t" end="41497712506t" region="region54" style="style0">Diterima.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1597" begin="41482692500t" end="41497712506t" region="region39" style="style0">Saya akan curi mata awak yang sebelah lagi. (KECEWA) Saya dah cakap</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1598" begin="41497712506t" end="41510227508t" region="region27" style="style0">menyelamatkan saya beberapa masalah Tetapi anda boleh mempunyai</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1599" begin="41510227508t" end="41522732500t" region="region40" style="style0">anda tidak memerlukannya. dan memberitahu saya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1600" begin="41522732500t" end="41536500003t" region="region32" style="style0">Ra menunjukkan saya jalan,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1601" begin="41522732500t" end="41536500003t" region="region37" style="style0">tetapi saya tidak mendengar.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1602" begin="41536500003t" end="41551927500t" region="region13" style="style0">Saya percaya saya memerlukan mata saya untuk berubah,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1603" begin="41551927500t" end="41562772500t" region="region44" style="style0">tetapi perjalanan saya bukan untuk membalas dendam pada semua kos.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1604" begin="41551927500t" end="41562772500t" region="region17" style="style0">Ia adalah untuk melindungi rakyat saya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1605" begin="41562772500t" end="41576957505t" region="region39" style="style0">Berhenti mengucapkan tahniah kepada diri sendiri.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1606" begin="41576957505t" end="41597812506t" region="region21" style="style0">melindungi untuk dilakukan. Anda ada lebih</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1607" begin="41576957505t" end="41597812506t" region="region36" style="style0">(MERENGANG LEMBUT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1608" begin="41597812506t" end="41611570000t" region="region51" style="style0">(ORANG BERSORAK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1609" begin="41597812506t" end="41611570000t" region="region42" style="style0">(SET MERENGUS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1610" begin="41597812506t" end="41611570000t" region="region80" style="style0">(SET MENGERANG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1611" begin="41626590003t" end="41641600000t" region="region1" style="style0">(MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1612" begin="41647862506t" end="41659125006t" region="region44" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1613" begin="41752127500t" end="41765477502t" region="region5" style="style0">(APOPHIS MENGGEMPAR)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1614" begin="41774235001t" end="41789255006t" region="region40" style="style0">(ASKAR MENJERIT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1615" begin="42076622503t" end="42092050000t" region="region42" style="style0">(MERENGANG LEMBUT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1616" begin="42099147506t" end="42119167506t" region="region36" style="style0">(BATUK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1617" begin="42099147506t" end="42119167506t" region="region100" style="style0">(BERNAFAS BERAT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1618" begin="42119167506t" end="42132507500t" region="region43" style="style0">Lihatlah, Raja yang baru.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1619" begin="42119167506t" end="42132507500t" region="region66" style="style0">yang paling agung dari segala tuhan. Saya fikir anda adalah</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1620" begin="42132507500t" end="42147527505t" region="region3" style="style0">Sekarang tengok awak. (Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1621" begin="42158372506t" end="42179227506t" region="region27" style="style0">Anda tidak mempunyai apa-apa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1622" begin="42179227506t" end="42199665006t" region="region56" style="style0">Saya adalah tuhan yang paling hebat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1623" begin="42199665006t" end="42222597500t" region="region61" style="style0">Saya selamatkan awak sekali.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1624" begin="42222597500t" end="42247210003t" region="region0" style="style0">Hah?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1625" begin="42222597500t" end="42247210003t" region="region60" style="style0">Saya menunjukkan belas kasihan kepada anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1626" begin="42247210003t" end="42291007508t" region="region121" style="style0">Saya tidak akan melakukan kesilapan itu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1627" begin="42247210003t" end="42291007508t" region="region41" style="style0">(Merengus)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1628" begin="42247210003t" end="42291007508t" region="region99" style="style0">HORUS: Atuk, masih ada masa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1629" begin="42291007508t" end="42317280003t" region="region56" style="style0">Cukuplah, binatang!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1630" begin="42317280003t" end="42352727500t" region="region48" style="style0">(APOPHIS MENGERUNG)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1631" begin="42317280003t" end="42352727500t" region="region3" style="style0">(Mengeluh)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1632" begin="42352727500t" end="42385680002t" region="region13" style="style0">terima kasih.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1633" begin="42352727500t" end="42385680002t" region="region38" style="style0">(ORANG BERSORAK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1634" begin="42385680002t" end="42417797505t" region="region53" style="style0">(TEPUK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1635" begin="42385680002t" end="42417797505t" region="region62" style="style0">HORUS: Kami membentuk pasukan yang baik.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1636" begin="42417797505t" end="42441992508t" region="region43" style="style0">awak bukan tuhan? Adakah anda pasti</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1637" begin="42417797505t" end="42441992508t" region="region30" style="style0">Apa yang saya akan menjadi tuhan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1638" begin="42441992508t" end="42468265005t" region="region18" style="style0">(Hembus nafas berat)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1639" begin="42498712506t" end="42517897505t" region="region42" style="style0">Kebodohan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1640" begin="42517897505t" end="42529995006t" region="region3" style="style0">Yang Mustahil.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1641" begin="42517897505t" end="42529995006t" region="region62" style="style0">pertahanan?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1642" begin="42529995006t" end="42559607506t" region="region40" style="style0">Saya tidak pernah berhutang.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1643" begin="42559607506t" end="42582957500t" region="region56" style="style0">Namun saya berhutang dengan awak, cucu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1644" begin="42582957500t" end="42599230006t" region="region3" style="style0">Tanya apa sahaja yang anda mahu.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1645" begin="42599230006t" end="42619667506t" region="region26" style="style0">Gunung akan berlutut di hadapan anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1646" begin="42599230006t" end="42619667506t" region="region61" style="style0">akan melakukan tawaran anda. Angin</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1647" begin="42619667506t" end="42643852500t" region="region38" style="style0">kerana Apophis masih lapar. Jawab dengan cepat,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1648" begin="42619667506t" end="42643852500t" region="region25" style="style0">Dan malam sentiasa datang.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1649" begin="42643852500t" end="42657202503t" region="region71" style="style0">Saya tidak mahu apa-apa.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1650" begin="42643852500t" end="42657202503t" region="region27" style="style0">Kecuali apa yang mustahil untuk saya berikan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1651" begin="42657202503t" end="42678892506t" region="region27" style="style0">(Tercungap-cungap)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1652" begin="42678892506t" end="42707670003t" region="region23" style="style0">adakah saya...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1653" begin="42678892506t" end="42707670003t" region="region24" style="style0">(KECEWA) Anda telah kembali. (KETAWA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1654" begin="42678892506t" end="42707670003t" region="region30" style="style0">HORUS: Mulut?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1655" begin="42707670003t" end="42728942506t" region="region32" style="style0">nak tolong dia. Anda mungkin</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1656" begin="42707670003t" end="42728942506t" region="region1" style="style0">Ia akan.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1657" begin="42728942506t" end="42745205001t" region="region42" style="style0">(ZAYA BERNAFAS BERAT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1658" begin="42745205001t" end="42765642502t" region="region40" style="style0">(LEMBUT) Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1659" begin="42745205001t" end="42765642502t" region="region38" style="style0">HORUS: Zaya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1660" begin="42765642502t" end="42779410006t" region="region30" style="style0">Saya Horus.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1661" begin="42779410006t" end="42799847506t" region="region19" style="style0">Tuanku.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1662" begin="42799847506t" end="42821537508t" region="region1" style="style0">Saya fikir ini adalah mustahil.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1663" begin="42821537508t" end="42840305006t" region="region17" style="style0">Mustahil? ya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1664" begin="42821537508t" end="42840305006t" region="region11" style="style0">(ORANG BERSORAK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1665" begin="42840305006t" end="42866160002t" region="region23" style="style0">ORANG RAMAI: Salam Ra, Tuan Cahaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1666" begin="42840305006t" end="42866160002t" region="region112" style="style0">Salam Ra, Tuhan Cahaya!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1667" begin="42840305006t" end="42866160002t" region="region47" style="style0">kebijaksanaan telah ditemui. ODER BEK: Dan sebagainya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1668" begin="42866160002t" end="42886180002t" region="region30" style="style0">Ujian telah dilalui. Peluang kedua diberi.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1669" begin="42886180002t" end="42908287505t" region="region28" style="style0">Untuk hidup semula.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1670" begin="42886180002t" end="42908287505t" region="region0" style="style0">Untuk kembali utuh.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1671" begin="42908287505t" end="42933307500t" region="region71" style="style0">Horus meratapi ibu bapanya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1672" begin="42908287505t" end="42933307500t" region="region64" style="style0">Mereka telah lama berlalu ke Alam Akhirat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1673" begin="42933307500t" end="42970017506t" region="region18" style="style0">itu adalah kebijaksanaan Ra Tetapi dia tahu</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1674" begin="42933307500t" end="42970017506t" region="region63" style="style0">kekal seperti sediakala. bahawa Gerbang Akhir akan</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1675" begin="42970017506t" end="42993367500t" region="region19" style="style0">Penghalang yang tidak dapat dipecahkan antara kehidupan ini dan keabadian.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1676" begin="42970017506t" end="42993367500t" region="region75" style="style0">Awak rasa saya sudah bersedia?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1677" begin="42993367500t" end="43011310007t" region="region66" style="style0">Hmm, kesediaan sebenar</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1678" begin="43011310007t" end="43023397500t" region="region71" style="style0">adalah keadaan yang terkenal sukar dicapai.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1679" begin="43011310007t" end="43023397500t" region="region99" style="style0">-Tetapi awak cukup dekat. -Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1680" begin="43023397500t" end="43041340007t" region="region76" style="style0">Bangun, Horus...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1681" begin="43041340007t" end="43055097501t" region="region4" style="style0">Raja seluruh Mesir.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1682" begin="43041340007t" end="43055097501t" region="region1" style="style0">(ORANG BERSORAK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1683" begin="43055097501t" end="43078040003t" region="region2" style="style0">Mulai saat ini,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1684" begin="43078040003t" end="43103477500t" region="region30" style="style0">Akhirat mesti diperolehi, bukan dengan emas,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1685" begin="43103477500t" end="43124750001t" region="region23" style="style0">tetapi dengan perbuatan baik, belas kasihan,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1686" begin="43103477500t" end="43124750001t" region="region64" style="style0">dan kemurahan hati.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1687" begin="43137265003t" end="43149780006t" region="region39" style="style0">Apa yang kita lakukan, bagaimana kita bertindak dalam kehidupan ini penting.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1688" begin="43155615001t" end="43183557500t" region="region44" style="style0">(ORANG BERSORAK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1689" begin="43155615001t" end="43183557500t" region="region63" style="style0">Adakah anda berfikir tentang dia?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1690" begin="43183557500t" end="43205665001t" region="region51" style="style0">Sudah tentu, anda.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1691" begin="43183557500t" end="43205665001t" region="region42" style="style0">Anda tidak fikir saya akan melesetkan khazanah terbesar Mesir?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1692" begin="43205665001t" end="43234442500t" region="region4" style="style0">jika saya pergi beberapa hari? Anda fikir mereka akan merindui saya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1693" begin="43205665001t" end="43234442500t" region="region98" style="style0">Sebagai Ketua Penasihat Raja,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1694" begin="43205665001t" end="43234442500t" region="region47" style="style0">menjadi kewajipan saya untuk memastikan mereka tidak menyedarinya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1695" begin="43234442500t" end="43258637505t" region="region18" style="style0">BEK: Tapi kalau ada yang tanya.. (TERKECAK)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1696" begin="43234442500t" end="43258637505t" region="region32" style="style0">untuk pergi membantu rakan. Beritahu mereka saya ada</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1697" begin="43258637505t" end="43274482500t" region="region65" style="style0">di tangan anda yang mampu. Saya meninggalkan Mesir</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1698" begin="43274482500t" end="43309522506t" region="region35" style="style0">(KECEWA)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1699" begin="43274482500t" end="43309522506t" region="region39" style="style0">of my parents</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1700" begin="43309522506t" end="43323697500t" region="region65" style="style0">have inconvenienced you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1701" begin="43323697500t" end="43360407506t" region="region51" style="style0">Apology accepted.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1702" begin="43323697500t" end="43360407506t" region="region39" style="style0">Now, get out!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1703" begin="43360407506t" end="43382515008t" region="region65" style="style0">But you have to help us!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1704" begin="43382515008t" end="43393767500t" region="region40" style="style0">(SWORDS CLATTERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1705" begin="43393767500t" end="43410875006t" region="region36" style="style0">THOTH: Careful.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1706" begin="43410875006t" end="43432147508t" region="region1" style="style0">I outnumber you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1707" begin="43450080006t" end="43463420000t" region="region42" style="style0">Whoa, whoa, whoa!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1708" begin="43482615008t" end="43502635008t" region="region62" style="style0">It's fine.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1709" begin="43482615008t" end="43502635008t" region="region25" style="style0">I'll do it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1710" begin="43502635008t" end="43524315000t" region="region43" style="style0">I thought you were</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1711" begin="43502635008t" end="43524315000t" region="region36" style="style0">a stray baboon.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1712" begin="43524315000t" end="43548510003t" region="region23" style="style0">I told you I'd be the one</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1713" begin="43524315000t" end="43548510003t" region="region40" style="style0">to face the Sphinx.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1714" begin="43548510003t" end="43576035001t" region="region33" style="style0">Your chance of failure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1715" begin="43548510003t" end="43576035001t" region="region1" style="style0">is overwhelming.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1716" begin="43576035001t" end="43596055001t" region="region18" style="style0">But before it kills me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1717" begin="43576035001t" end="43596055001t" region="region50" style="style0">I'm sure.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1718" begin="43596055001t" end="43609822506t" region="region32" style="style0">I'm going to tell it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1719" begin="43596055001t" end="43609822506t" region="region5" style="style0">that I asked</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1720" begin="43609822506t" end="43626502502t" region="region53" style="style0">the God of Wisdom to come</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1721" begin="43626502502t" end="43644017500t" region="region28" style="style0">he'd get the answer wrong.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1722" begin="43626502502t" end="43644017500t" region="region51" style="style0">but he was afraid</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1723" begin="43644017500t" end="43669882506t" region="region111" style="style0">This is the cleverest strategy</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1724" begin="43644017500t" end="43669882506t" region="region42" style="style0">you could devise?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1725" begin="43669882506t" end="43684057500t" region="region44" style="style0">Playing on my ego?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1726" begin="43684057500t" end="43705330001t" region="region56" style="style0">How vain do you think I am?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1727" begin="43738282503t" end="43752467508t" region="region37" style="style0">Um... Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1728" begin="43783332508t" end="43795420001t" region="region5" style="style0">Yes, well...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1729" begin="43802100007t" end="43813770000t" region="region78" style="style0">Fine.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1730" begin="43822537508t" end="43834207500t" region="region78" style="style0">Fine!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1731" begin="43872587508t" end="43884257500t" region="region61" style="style0">Let's go.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1732" begin="43902617508t" end="43914287500t" region="region11" style="style0">Bye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1733" begin="43934307500t" end="43948492503t" region="region37" style="style0">Well done.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1734" begin="43948492503t" end="43963095008t" region="region37" style="style0">Thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1735" begin="44113245008t" end="44134507500t" region="region23" style="style0">HATHOR: You know his Zaya</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1736" begin="44113245008t" end="44134507500t" region="region99" style="style0">can never come back.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1737" begin="44134507500t" end="44154527500t" region="region21" style="style0">The King doesn't</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1738" begin="44134507500t" end="44154527500t" region="region36" style="style0">have the power.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1739" begin="44154527500t" end="44174965000t" region="region83" style="style0">Anubis doesn't</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1740" begin="44154527500t" end="44174965000t" region="region36" style="style0">have the power.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1741" begin="44174965000t" end="44188732503t" region="region42" style="style0">You deceived him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1742" begin="44204577500t" end="44230442506t" region="region122" style="style0">He will probably die</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1743" begin="44204577500t" end="44230442506t" region="region40" style="style0">into Set's pyramid.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1744" begin="44204577500t" end="44230442506t" region="region10" style="style0">trying to break</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1745" begin="44230442506t" end="44249210003t" region="region13" style="style0">He offered his life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1746" begin="44249210003t" end="44265472500t" region="region43" style="style0">Because he thought</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1747" begin="44249210003t" end="44265472500t" region="region44" style="style0">he could save her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1748" begin="44265472500t" end="44284657500t" region="region0" style="style0">He believes what he</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1749" begin="44265472500t" end="44284657500t" region="region42" style="style0">wants to believe.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1750" begin="44284657500t" end="44314687500t" region="region18" style="style0">in more ways than one.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1751" begin="44284657500t" end="44314687500t" region="region51" style="style0">You've been blind</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1752" begin="44314687500t" end="44334707500t" region="region26" style="style0">You really watched the world</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1753" begin="44314687500t" end="44334707500t" region="region1" style="style0">come into being?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1754" begin="44334707500t" end="44353902508t" region="region5" style="style0">I don't lie.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1755" begin="44353902508t" end="44365572500t" region="region42" style="style0">watching it from,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1756" begin="44353902508t" end="44365572500t" region="region83" style="style0">Where were you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1757" begin="44365572500t" end="44382680007t" region="region0" style="style0">if nothing had been</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1758" begin="44365572500t" end="44382680007t" region="region89" style="style0">created yet?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1759" begin="44382680007t" end="44408535003t" region="region0" style="style0">If I even attempted</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1760" begin="44382680007t" end="44408535003t" region="region25" style="style0">to explain,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1761" begin="44408535003t" end="44426885001t" region="region69" style="style0">your brain would liquefy</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1762" begin="44408535003t" end="44426885001t" region="region53" style="style0">and run out of your ears.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1763" begin="44443575008t" end="44469012503t" region="region44" style="style0">a path of revenge.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1764" begin="44443575008t" end="44469012503t" region="region21" style="style0">I did not choose</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1765" begin="44469012503t" end="44486527501t" region="region3" style="style0">I chose none of this.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1766" begin="44486527501t" end="44504877500t" region="region111" style="style0">You tell me what kind of power</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1767" begin="44486527501t" end="44504877500t" region="region42" style="style0">do I really have?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1768" begin="44504877500t" end="44534082508t" region="region67" style="style0">You have the power</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1769" begin="44504877500t" end="44534082508t" region="region40" style="style0">to make this right.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1770" begin="44534082508t" end="44554927500t" region="region44" style="style0">to know the truth.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1771" begin="44534082508t" end="44554927500t" region="region63" style="style0">He deserves</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1772" begin="44554927500t" end="44589132503t" region="region41" style="style0">I need him to get us in</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1773" begin="44554927500t" end="44589132503t" region="region99" style="style0">to choke Set's fire.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1774" begin="44589132503t" end="44612492507t" region="region18" style="style0">Is that what you want?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1775" begin="44589132503t" end="44612492507t" region="region117" style="style0">If he refuses,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1776" begin="44589132503t" end="44612492507t" region="region17" style="style0">we'll all die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1777" begin="44735107500t" end="44758885003t" region="region67" style="style0">It's too dangerous</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1778" begin="44735107500t" end="44758885003t" region="region40" style="style0">to cross the plain.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1779" begin="44758885003t" end="44773905008t" region="region65" style="style0">We'll wait for darkness.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1780" begin="44773905008t" end="44793090007t" region="region54" style="style0">But we're running out</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1781" begin="44773905008t" end="44793090007t" region="region70" style="style0">of time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1782" begin="44793090007t" end="44809770003t" region="region32" style="style0">-I say we cross now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1783" begin="44793090007t" end="44809770003t" region="region40" style="style0">-And I say we wait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1784" begin="44833547508t" end="44845217500t" region="region61" style="style0">(EXHALES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1785" begin="44918210002t" end="44955327500t" region="region26" style="style0">All the time you were apart,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1786" begin="44918210002t" end="44955327500t" region="region3" style="style0">she never forgot you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1787" begin="44968260002t" end="44992037506t" region="region53" style="style0">Hathor's heart, you know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1788" begin="44968260002t" end="44992037506t" region="region54" style="style0">You've always been in</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1789" begin="44992037506t" end="45014145008t" region="region43" style="style0">Yes, but she's got</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1790" begin="44992037506t" end="45014145008t" region="region5" style="style0">a big heart.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1791" begin="45014145008t" end="45027902502t" region="region41" style="style0">Room enough for a crowd</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1792" begin="45014145008t" end="45027902502t" region="region61" style="style0">in there.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1793" begin="45043340007t" end="45078370002t" region="region33" style="style0">Tell me, oh, wise Lord</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1794" begin="45043340007t" end="45078370002t" region="region25" style="style0">of the Air.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1795" begin="45078370002t" end="45098390002t" region="region52" style="style0">Why do you think</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1796" begin="45078370002t" end="45098390002t" region="region42" style="style0">Set let you live?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1797" begin="45121750006t" end="45136342500t" region="region13" style="style0">She did it for love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1798" begin="45136342500t" end="45165537500t" region="region28" style="style0">You'd punish her for that?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1799" begin="45165537500t" end="45185557500t" region="region27" style="style0">I didn't want her help.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1800" begin="45204752508t" end="45225180000t" region="region58" style="style0">I only ever wanted one thing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1801" begin="45235607500t" end="45276482500t" region="region28" style="style0">I think everyone's a fool.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1802" begin="45235607500t" end="45276482500t" region="region123" style="style0">You know,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1803" begin="45276482500t" end="45303182507t" region="region3" style="style0">are bigger than most.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1804" begin="45276482500t" end="45303182507t" region="region51" style="style0">But you, My Lord,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1805" begin="45475022508t" end="45485857500t" region="region40" style="style0">thinking about her?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1806" begin="45475022508t" end="45485857500t" region="region10" style="style0">HATHOR: Are you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1807" begin="45518810002t" end="45532995006t" region="region44" style="style0">Of course you are.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1808" begin="45555927500t" end="45588045001t" region="region19" style="style0">as the Mistress of the West.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1809" begin="45555927500t" end="45588045001t" region="region21" style="style0">I was once known</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1810" begin="45588045001t" end="45613910007t" region="region0" style="style0">My duty was to help</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1811" begin="45588045001t" end="45613910007t" region="region64" style="style0">dead souls</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1812" begin="45613910007t" end="45632260006t" region="region42" style="style0">to the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1813" begin="45613910007t" end="45632260006t" region="region83" style="style0">make their way</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1814" begin="45632260006t" end="45654367508t" region="region65" style="style0">to the Land of the Dead?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1815" begin="45632260006t" end="45654367508t" region="region75" style="style0">You traveled</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1816" begin="45654367508t" end="45680222503t" region="region19" style="style0">Even to those who have died.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1817" begin="45654367508t" end="45680222503t" region="region4" style="style0">I'm the Goddess of Love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1818" begin="45694407508t" end="45724437508t" region="region19" style="style0">I was young. Easily seduced.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1819" begin="45724437508t" end="45738195001t" region="region37" style="style0">"Seduced"?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1820" begin="45738195001t" end="45753215006t" region="region66" style="style0">Demons.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1821" begin="45753215006t" end="45774487508t" region="region27" style="style0">This keeps them at bay.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1822" begin="45774487508t" end="45806177500t" region="region53" style="style0">The Bracelet of 42 Stars.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1823" begin="45806177500t" end="45836207500t" region="region35" style="style0">One for each of the demons</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1824" begin="45806177500t" end="45836207500t" region="region65" style="style0">Horus slayed to free me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1825" begin="45836207500t" end="45856227500t" region="region43" style="style0">That's when I knew</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1826" begin="45836207500t" end="45856227500t" region="region5" style="style0">I loved him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1827" begin="45856227500t" end="45882510006t" region="region65" style="style0">you're fighting for her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1828" begin="45856227500t" end="45882510006t" region="region43" style="style0">Zaya needs to know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1829" begin="45882510006t" end="45895850000t" region="region28" style="style0">So she does not lose hope.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1830" begin="45956327500t" end="45970512503t" region="region1" style="style0">(WHISPERS) Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1831" begin="46006377500t" end="46017640001t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1832" begin="46041417505t" end="46075205008t" region="region1" style="style0">Can you hear me?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1833" begin="46041417505t" end="46075205008t" region="region63" style="style0">Zaya? Zaya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1834" begin="46081040003t" end="46094807508t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1835" begin="46098555001t" end="46113157506t" region="region37" style="style0">Who is it?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1836" begin="46125255008t" end="46142770006t" region="region5" style="style0">Who's there?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1837" begin="46142770006t" end="46170295003t" region="region6" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1838" begin="46142770006t" end="46170295003t" region="region36" style="style0">ZAYA:</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1839" begin="46170295003t" end="46190732503t" region="region19" style="style0">from the Land of the Living.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1840" begin="46170295003t" end="46190732503t" region="region17" style="style0">I speak to you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1841" begin="46190732503t" end="46205335008t" region="region65" style="style0">Your beloved is with me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1842" begin="46205335008t" end="46219927502t" region="region30" style="style0">Zaya, it's me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1843" begin="46205335008t" end="46219927502t" region="region102" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1844" begin="46238695001t" end="46254967508t" region="region35" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1845" begin="46238695001t" end="46254967508t" region="region44" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1846" begin="46270812503t" end="46287492500t" region="region13" style="style0">But I can't see you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1847" begin="46287492500t" end="46300842503t" region="region93" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1848" begin="46287492500t" end="46300842503t" region="region75" style="style0">BEK:</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1849" begin="46300842503t" end="46310435003t" region="region7" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1850" begin="46310435003t" end="46325455008t" region="region76" style="style0">But how?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1851" begin="46332542506t" end="46346717500t" region="region44" style="style0">I'm helping Horus.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1852" begin="46346717500t" end="46366737500t" region="region18" style="style0">he's going to help us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1853" begin="46346717500t" end="46366737500t" region="region46" style="style0">In return,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1854" begin="46366737500t" end="46386757500t" region="region43" style="style0">ZAYA:</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1855" begin="46366737500t" end="46386757500t" region="region7" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1856" begin="46386757500t" end="46407612500t" region="region35" style="style0">I know, Zaya. I can hardly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1857" begin="46386757500t" end="46407612500t" region="region44" style="style0">believe it myself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1858" begin="46407612500t" end="46426380000t" region="region0" style="style0">(CHUCKLES) Bek, me,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1859" begin="46407612500t" end="46426380000t" region="region60" style="style0">trusting the gods.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1860" begin="46436807500t" end="46452662506t" region="region18" style="style0">But I was wrong, Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1861" begin="46452662506t" end="46472682506t" region="region65" style="style0">as you said he would be.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1862" begin="46452662506t" end="46472682506t" region="region32" style="style0">Horus is a just god,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1863" begin="46472682506t" end="46492702506t" region="region56" style="style0">"I told you so," right now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1864" begin="46472682506t" end="46492702506t" region="region23" style="style0">You're probably thinking,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1865" begin="46492702506t" end="46518140001t" region="region48" style="style0">Well, yes. Just a little bit.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1866" begin="46492702506t" end="46518140001t" region="region70" style="style0">(LAUGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1867" begin="46533995006t" end="46551510003t" region="region40" style="style0">to hear your voice.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1868" begin="46533995006t" end="46551510003t" region="region88" style="style0">It's so good</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1869" begin="46551510003t" end="46569442502t" region="region20" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1870" begin="46551510003t" end="46569442502t" region="region41" style="style0">BEK:</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1871" begin="46569442502t" end="46589880002t" region="region44" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1872" begin="46569442502t" end="46589880002t" region="region17" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1873" begin="46589880002t" end="46605317508t" region="region7" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1874" begin="46617822500t" end="46632007505t" region="region11" style="style0">Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1875" begin="46642017505t" end="46656202508t" region="region40" style="style0">Bek, are you there?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1876" begin="46659950002t" end="46679552502t" region="region21" style="style0">(STAFF CLATTERS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1877" begin="46659950002t" end="46679552502t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1878" begin="46679552502t" end="46709582502t" region="region26" style="style0">It is forbidden for the dead</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1879" begin="46679552502t" end="46709582502t" region="region53" style="style0">to speak with the living.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1880" begin="46727932500t" end="46742117505t" region="region85" style="style0">Go.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1881" begin="46971930003t" end="46988192500t" region="region27" style="style0">There's a wheel inside.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1882" begin="46988192500t" end="47009465001t" region="region18" style="style0">the sand stops moving.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1883" begin="46988192500t" end="47009465001t" region="region51" style="style0">When you turn it,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1884" begin="47009465001t" end="47027397500t" region="region27" style="style0">to go through the door.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1885" begin="47009465001t" end="47027397500t" region="region88" style="style0">We just need</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1886" begin="47027397500t" end="47046592508t" region="region43" style="style0">Good thing you saw</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1887" begin="47027397500t" end="47046592508t" region="region5" style="style0">those plans.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1888" begin="47046592508t" end="47067437500t" region="region23" style="style0">HORUS: If you didn't know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1889" begin="47046592508t" end="47067437500t" region="region42" style="style0">which one it was,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1890" begin="47067437500t" end="47079952502t" region="region0" style="style0">this would truly be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1891" begin="47067437500t" end="47079952502t" region="region25" style="style0">impossible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1892" begin="47094555006t" end="47117487500t" region="region74" style="style0">-Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1893" begin="47094555006t" end="47117487500t" region="region78" style="style0">-Yes?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1894" begin="47117487500t" end="47137507500t" region="region53" style="style0">which is the door, right?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1895" begin="47117487500t" end="47137507500t" region="region63" style="style0">You do know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1896" begin="47147517500t" end="47161702503t" region="region27" style="style0">Yes, of course, it's...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1897" begin="47161702503t" end="47176305008t" region="region61" style="style0">This one.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1898" begin="47188392500t" end="47204247506t" region="region10" style="style0">No, no, it's...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1899" begin="47188392500t" end="47204247506t" region="region59" style="style0">It's that one.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1900" begin="47213422506t" end="47225937508t" region="region18" style="style0">No, no, it's this one!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1901" begin="47352727505t" end="47367320000t" region="region36" style="style0">Roll the bones.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1902" begin="47377747500t" end="47396525008t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1903" begin="47487857500t" end="47501207502t" region="region61" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1904" begin="47650105001t" end="47664707506t" region="region61" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1905" begin="47684727506t" end="47699320001t" region="region40" style="style0">(RHYTHMIC THUMPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1906" begin="47781905003t" end="47795672507t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1907" begin="47814440006t" end="47824450006t" region="region40" style="style0">THOTH: You guessed?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1908" begin="47824450006t" end="47842800003t" region="region44" style="style0">(STUTTERS) Well...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1909" begin="47842800003t" end="47878247500t" region="region33" style="style0">I find your dependence</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1910" begin="47842800003t" end="47878247500t" region="region13" style="style0">on chance troubling.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1911" begin="47878247500t" end="47892850003t" region="region10" style="style0">If you continue</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1912" begin="47878247500t" end="47892850003t" region="region25" style="style0">to survive,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1913" begin="47892850003t" end="47907860000t" region="region0" style="style0">I may need to study</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1914" begin="47892850003t" end="47907860000t" region="region89" style="style0">you further.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1915" begin="47916627508t" end="47937482508t" region="region65" style="style0">which way to the Sphinx?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1916" begin="47916627508t" end="47937482508t" region="region124" style="style0">Now,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1917" begin="48259462500t" end="48288657500t" region="region4" style="style0">Trespassers in the House</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1918" begin="48259462500t" end="48288657500t" region="region5" style="style0">of the King,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1919" begin="48288657500t" end="48316192507t" region="region21" style="style0">answer my riddle</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1920" begin="48288657500t" end="48316192507t" region="region36" style="style0">or cease to be.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1921" begin="48323697505t" end="48338290000t" region="region47" style="style0">Go on.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1922" begin="48343300003t" end="48357902508t" region="region86" style="style0">I'm waiting.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1923" begin="48362902503t" end="48376670007t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROWLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1924" begin="48376670007t" end="48394185005t" region="region5" style="style0">I never was.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1925" begin="48408777500t" end="48428797500t" region="region1" style="style0">Am always to be.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1926" begin="48428797500t" end="48466760007t" region="region0" style="style0">No one ever saw me,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1927" begin="48428797500t" end="48466760007t" region="region59" style="style0">nor ever will.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1928" begin="48466760007t" end="48504712506t" region="region71" style="style0">And yet I am the confidence</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1929" begin="48466760007t" end="48504712506t" region="region19" style="style0">of all who live and breathe.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1930" begin="48504712506t" end="48538082508t" region="region37" style="style0">What am I?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1931" begin="48548917500t" end="48578530000t" region="region3" style="style0">Order. You are Order.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1932" begin="48621075001t" end="48636095006t" region="region13" style="style0">I never doubted you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1933" begin="48660697501t" end="48678222508t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1934" begin="48689057500t" end="48701572502t" region="region37" style="style0">Incorrect.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1935" begin="48717010007t" end="48737865008t" region="region44" style="style0">Try again. Please.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1936" begin="48758302508t" end="48776235006t" region="region54" style="style0">That was a completely</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1937" begin="48758302508t" end="48776235006t" region="region55" style="style0">suitable answer.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1938" begin="48782905003t" end="48794167505t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1939" begin="48794167505t" end="48810430001t" region="region36" style="style0">You are Purity.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1940" begin="48839207500t" end="48851722502t" region="region95" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1941" begin="48839207500t" end="48851722502t" region="region61" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1942" begin="48870907501t" end="48884257505t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1943" begin="48884257505t" end="48909277500t" region="region5" style="style0">Wrong again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1944" begin="48909277500t" end="48929297500t" region="region42" style="style0">"What never was."</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1945" begin="48909277500t" end="48929297500t" region="region88" style="style0">(STUTTERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1946" begin="48929297500t" end="48955162506t" region="region36" style="style0">"Always to be."</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1947" begin="48955162506t" end="48973512503t" region="region26" style="style0">In the future. Non-existent.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1948" begin="48955162506t" end="48973512503t" region="region37" style="style0">Imaginary.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1949" begin="48973512503t" end="48988115008t" region="region61" style="style0">(ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1950" begin="48999785000t" end="49015640006t" region="region82" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1951" begin="48999785000t" end="49015640006t" region="region47" style="style0">Yet...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1952" begin="49015640006t" end="49043165003t" region="region32" style="style0">THOTH: Yet it exists</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1953" begin="49015640006t" end="49043165003t" region="region1" style="style0">and "never was."</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1954" begin="49043165003t" end="49073195003t" region="region13" style="style0">(STRAINING) Thoth...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1955" begin="49043165003t" end="49073195003t" region="region10" style="style0">"Always to be."</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1956" begin="49073195003t" end="49097390007t" region="region19" style="style0">of all who live and breathe.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1957" begin="49073195003t" end="49097390007t" region="region33" style="style0">Yet I'm the confidence</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1958" begin="49097390007t" end="49109477500t" region="region53" style="style0">Mortals live and breathe!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1959" begin="49109477500t" end="49125332506t" region="region0" style="style0">Maybe stop thinking</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1960" begin="49109477500t" end="49125332506t" region="region25" style="style0">like a god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1961" begin="49125332506t" end="49135342506t" region="region32" style="style0">Then I might as well</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1962" begin="49125332506t" end="49135342506t" region="region30" style="style0">stop thinking.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1963" begin="49135342506t" end="49148275008t" region="region47" style="style0">Thoth!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1964" begin="49154110003t" end="49169537500t" region="region72" style="style0">Wait, wait, I have it!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1965" begin="49169537500t" end="49187480007t" region="region42" style="style0">You are Tomorrow.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1966" begin="49187480007t" end="49206247506t" region="region25" style="style0">Oh, bother.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1967" begin="49227937508t" end="49239607500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1968" begin="49294250003t" end="49308852508t" region="region36" style="style0">(SPHINX GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1969" begin="49429797500t" end="49442312502t" region="region1" style="style0">HORUS: One drop.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1970" begin="49558267508t" end="49570772500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1971" begin="49570772500t" end="49583705003t" region="region85" style="style0">No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1972" begin="49583705003t" end="49597055006t" region="region2" style="style0">(VOICES ECHOING AND MURMURING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1973" begin="49614152503t" end="49628755008t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1974" begin="49664620003t" end="49680047500t" region="region40" style="style0">I should thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1975" begin="49695067505t" end="49716340006t" region="region111" style="style0">You lured him from his library</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1976" begin="49695067505t" end="49716340006t" region="region53" style="style0">so that I didn't have to.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1977" begin="49750117500t" end="49768060007t" region="region1" style="style0">The final piece.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1978" begin="49768060007t" end="49783070002t" region="region25" style="style0">You coward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1979" begin="49783070002t" end="49798507508t" region="region17" style="style0">Open this gate</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1980" begin="49783070002t" end="49798507508t" region="region39" style="style0">and fight me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1981" begin="49798507508t" end="49809760000t" region="region47" style="style0">Again?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1982" begin="49820187500t" end="49850217500t" region="region125" style="style0">Hasn't she's seen you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1983" begin="49820187500t" end="49850217500t" region="region89" style="style0">lose enough?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1984" begin="49850217500t" end="49862315001t" region="region43" style="style0">Can't you allow me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1985" begin="49850217500t" end="49862315001t" region="region5" style="style0">to spare you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1986" begin="49862315001t" end="49883170002t" region="region10" style="style0">one last moment</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1987" begin="49862315001t" end="49883170002t" region="region1" style="style0">of embarrassment</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1988" begin="49883170002t" end="49897772507t" region="region36" style="style0">before you die?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1989" begin="49900685000t" end="49917792507t" region="region78" style="style0">Stop!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1990" begin="49932802502t" end="49947405006t" region="region36" style="style0">Recognize this?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1991" begin="49973260002t" end="49995785005t" region="region111" style="style0">Did he tell you he could bring</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1992" begin="49973260002t" end="49995785005t" region="region56" style="style0">your woman back from death?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1993" begin="50009552508t" end="50022475001t" region="region44" style="style0">It's not possible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1994" begin="50030397500t" end="50047505006t" region="region1" style="style0">Not even for me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1995" begin="50047505006t" end="50060010000t" region="region58" style="style0">You expect me to believe you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1996" begin="50078787508t" end="50091292500t" region="region13" style="style0">I don't have to lie.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1997" begin="50100467500t" end="50125497505t" region="region41" style="style0">How else would a blind,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1998" begin="50100467500t" end="50125497505t" region="region25" style="style0">useless god</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle1999" begin="50125497505t" end="50137595006t" region="region13" style="style0">get you to help him?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2000" begin="50156780006t" end="50170120000t" region="region47" style="style0">Go on.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2001" begin="50173042502t" end="50187227506t" region="region76" style="style0">Ask him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2002" begin="50206412506t" end="50227267506t" region="region75" style="style0">-Pour it in.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2003" begin="50206412506t" end="50227267506t" region="region5" style="style0">-Is it true?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2004" begin="50227267506t" end="50243947502t" region="region1" style="style0">Bek, pour it in!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2005" begin="50258550007t" end="50270220000t" region="region85" style="style0">No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2006" begin="50277735006t" end="50290240000t" region="region5" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2007" begin="50390757500t" end="50415787505t" region="region51" style="style0">Shame you weren't</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2008" begin="50390757500t" end="50415787505t" region="region25" style="style0">on my side.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2009" begin="50415787505t" end="50447070006t" region="region33" style="style0">that doesn't let death</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2010" begin="50415787505t" end="50447070006t" region="region42" style="style0">stand in his way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2011" begin="50415787505t" end="50447070006t" region="region87" style="style0">I admire someone</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2012" begin="50447070006t" end="50478352507t" region="region21" style="style0">But this is what</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2013" begin="50447070006t" end="50478352507t" region="region30" style="style0">love gets you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2014" begin="50500867500t" end="50517557506t" region="region43" style="style0">It's quite fitting</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2015" begin="50500867500t" end="50517557506t" region="region1" style="style0">that you'll both</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2016" begin="50517557506t" end="50538830007t" region="region51" style="style0">die together here</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2017" begin="50517557506t" end="50538830007t" region="region89" style="style0">in my house.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2018" begin="50538830007t" end="50555927505t" region="region56" style="style0">I'll miss the conversation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2019" begin="50555927505t" end="50570520000t" region="region39" style="style0">And the rest.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2020" begin="50613900002t" end="50628085006t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2021" begin="50665202503t" end="50679805008t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2022" begin="50851217500t" end="50863315001t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2023" begin="50995950003t" end="51011795000t" region="region30" style="style0">(HORUS GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2024" begin="51031397500t" end="51045582503t" region="region37" style="style0">(COUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2025" begin="51085205003t" end="51098137506t" region="region42" style="style0">(EXHALES HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2026" begin="51098137506t" end="51113147501t" region="region65" style="style0">You denied me vengeance.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2027" begin="51113147501t" end="51131497500t" region="region61" style="style0">(PANTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2028" begin="51131497500t" end="51146517505t" region="region3" style="style0">Zaya thought you were</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2029" begin="51146517505t" end="51156527505t" region="region67" style="style0">the greatest thing</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2030" begin="51146517505t" end="51156527505t" region="region40" style="style0">in all of creation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2031" begin="51171537500t" end="51187810006t" region="region48" style="style0">Every day, she prayed for you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2032" begin="51171537500t" end="51187810006t" region="region59" style="style0">to save Egypt,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2033" begin="51187810006t" end="51199490007t" region="region13" style="style0">but you didn't come.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2034" begin="51199490007t" end="51221587500t" region="region21" style="style0">I was in a tomb.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2035" begin="51199490007t" end="51221587500t" region="region30" style="style0">I didn't hear.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2036" begin="51221587500t" end="51242025000t" region="region18" style="style0">No, you didn't listen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2037" begin="51242025000t" end="51256210003t" region="region53" style="style0">is your stupid vengeance.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2038" begin="51242025000t" end="51256210003t" region="region67" style="style0">All you care about</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2039" begin="51276230003t" end="51294162502t" region="region18" style="style0">I was wrong about you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2040" begin="51276230003t" end="51294162502t" region="region43" style="style0">I started to think</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2041" begin="51311677500t" end="51326280003t" region="region4" style="style0">But I've finally learned</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2042" begin="51311677500t" end="51326280003t" region="region27" style="style0">the lesson of the gods.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2043" begin="51326280003t" end="51341290000t" region="region27" style="style0">We don't matter to you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2044" begin="51366320003t" end="51378417506t" region="region40" style="style0">Well, now you know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2045" begin="51556092503t" end="51569442507t" region="region40" style="style0">Anubis, come forth.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2046" begin="51620745008t" end="51634085001t" region="region37" style="style0">(SNARLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2047" begin="51642007500t" end="51662027500t" region="region61" style="style0">Mistress.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2048" begin="51662027500t" end="51692057500t" region="region19" style="style0">as lovely as the first dawn.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2049" begin="51662027500t" end="51692057500t" region="region38" style="style0">You are still</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2050" begin="51692057500t" end="51712077500t" region="region56" style="style0">Hathor, what are you doing?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2051" begin="51712077500t" end="51742107500t" region="region71" style="style0">This mortal's beloved bears</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2052" begin="51712077500t" end="51742107500t" region="region56" style="style0">no treasure for the scales.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2053" begin="51742107500t" end="51761302508t" region="region65" style="style0">Perhaps we can help her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2054" begin="51761302508t" end="51786322503t" region="region27" style="style0">You ask much, Mistress.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2055" begin="51786322503t" end="51822187500t" region="region41" style="style0">It would require a very</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2056" begin="51786322503t" end="51822187500t" region="region65" style="style0">special treasure indeed.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2057" begin="51822187500t" end="51836372503t" region="region85" style="style0">No.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2058" begin="51836372503t" end="51853052500t" region="region25" style="style0">-Like this?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2059" begin="51836372503t" end="51853052500t" region="region82" style="style0">-No. No!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2060" begin="51853052500t" end="51881005008t" region="region3" style="style0">Mistress of the West?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2061" begin="51853052500t" end="51881005008t" region="region95" style="style0">For you,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2062" begin="51892257500t" end="51912277500t" region="region11" style="style0">Yes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2063" begin="51912277500t" end="51931880000t" region="region28" style="style0">to give it to her himself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2064" begin="51912277500t" end="51931880000t" region="region51" style="style0">Grant him passage</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2065" begin="51964415001t" end="51979852507t" region="region21" style="style0">You will see her</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2066" begin="51964415001t" end="51979852507t" region="region30" style="style0">one last time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2067" begin="51986522503t" end="52001125008t" region="region37" style="style0">Thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2068" begin="52019057506t" end="52041165008t" region="region13" style="style0">No, no, I forbid it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2069" begin="52041165008t" end="52062427500t" region="region51" style="style0">We're both guilty</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2070" begin="52041165008t" end="52062427500t" region="region42" style="style0">of deceiving Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2071" begin="52062427500t" end="52076195003t" region="region18" style="style0">This will make amends.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2072" begin="52076195003t" end="52111652508t" region="region17" style="style0">Not like this.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2073" begin="52076195003t" end="52111652508t" region="region39" style="style0">Not with you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2074" begin="52111652508t" end="52136255003t" region="region38" style="style0">I command you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2075" begin="52111652508t" end="52136255003t" region="region30" style="style0">to release me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2076" begin="52136255003t" end="52170042507t" region="region54" style="style0">You can't command me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2077" begin="52136255003t" end="52170042507t" region="region39" style="style0">You know why.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2078" begin="52199237506t" end="52215917502t" region="region65" style="style0">I'm the Goddess of Love.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2079" begin="52241365008t" end="52270977508t" region="region0" style="style0">If I don't do this,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2080" begin="52241365008t" end="52270977508t" region="region89" style="style0">I'm nothing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2081" begin="52270977508t" end="52292240000t" region="region27" style="style0">I can't lose you again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2082" begin="52427380003t" end="52441565008t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2083" begin="52670960007t" end="52682630000t" region="region76" style="style0">Take it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2084" begin="52795662502t" end="52812760000t" region="region27" style="style0">Do what you need to do.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2085" begin="53003367500t" end="53017970003t" region="region27" style="style0">The Hall of Two Truths.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2086" begin="53034232500t" end="53053000000t" region="region53" style="style0">Where we shall be judged.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2087" begin="53079700006t" end="53098467505t" region="region53" style="style0">HEAD JUDGE: Step forward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2088" begin="53239442506t" end="53256122502t" region="region44" style="style0">What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2089" begin="53297832503t" end="53312435008t" region="region1" style="style0">(SCALE CLICKING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2090" begin="53336620002t" end="53351222507t" region="region39" style="style0">Step forward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2091" begin="53393757500t" end="53433380000t" region="region3" style="style0">I shall live forever!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2092" begin="53473012508t" end="53488440003t" region="region2" style="style0">HEAD JUDGE: What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2093" begin="53540995006t" end="53553500000t" region="region1" style="style0">(SCALE CLICKING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2094" begin="53586452502t" end="53613560000t" region="region39" style="style0">Step forward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2095" begin="53718252503t" end="53732855008t" region="region25" style="style0">(SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2096" begin="53788740003t" end="53807507502t" region="region39" style="style0">Step forward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2097" begin="53908025003t" end="53928880003t" region="region44" style="style0">What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2098" begin="53948065003t" end="53973919999t" region="region44" style="style0">What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2099" begin="54064427500t" end="54076942502t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2100" begin="54084447500t" end="54099050003t" region="region18" style="style0">(CHUCKLES SOFTLY) Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2101" begin="54323862508t" end="54342212507t" region="region39" style="style0">(SET ROARING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2102" begin="54363902508t" end="54383922508t" region="region5" style="style0">SLAVES: Set,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2103" begin="54383922508t" end="54416865001t" region="region4" style="style0">receive the golden wings</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2104" begin="54383922508t" end="54416865001t" region="region5" style="style0">of Nephthys.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2105" begin="54416865001t" end="54449400003t" region="region28" style="style0">from those who would harm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2106" begin="54416865001t" end="54449400003t" region="region32" style="style0">May they protect him</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2107" begin="54538655003t" end="54552422507t" region="region37" style="style0">(CLANKING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2108" begin="54576607501t" end="54614977500t" region="region35" style="style0">SLAVES: The karr of Thoth,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2109" begin="54576607501t" end="54614977500t" region="region30" style="style0">God of Wisdom.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2110" begin="54614977500t" end="54640425005t" region="region56" style="style0">Allow him knowledge of old.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2111" begin="54659610003t" end="54671707506t" region="region27" style="style0">(ELECTRICITY CRACKLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2112" begin="54699650003t" end="54723845008t" region="region13" style="style0">The heart of Osiris.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2113" begin="54723845008t" end="54754292508t" region="region43" style="style0">Grant him dominion</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2114" begin="54723845008t" end="54754292508t" region="region36" style="style0">over all Lands.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2115" begin="54775137500t" end="54795157500t" region="region40" style="style0">The all-seeing eye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2116" begin="54795157500t" end="54831867506t" region="region33" style="style0">Reward him so no enemy</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2117" begin="54795157500t" end="54831867506t" region="region5" style="style0">can deceive.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2118" begin="54855217500t" end="54868567502t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2119" begin="54944482508t" end="54956570001t" region="region5" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2120" begin="54999950003t" end="55017882502t" region="region65" style="style0">You look glorious, Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2121" begin="55055835000t" end="55072942507t" region="region66" style="style0">I know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2122" begin="55273560007t" end="55285647500t" region="region30" style="style0">SET: Father...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2123" begin="55328192502t" end="55354057508t" region="region32" style="style0">I noticed the tower.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2124" begin="55328192502t" end="55354057508t" region="region25" style="style0">Impressive.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2125" begin="55361562506t" end="55379912503t" region="region40" style="style0">I built it for you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2126" begin="55379912503t" end="55410777505t" region="region33" style="style0">If it were any taller,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2127" begin="55379912503t" end="55410777505t" region="region18" style="style0">it would be in my way.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2128" begin="55410777505t" end="55442895006t" region="region83" style="style0">Turn your eyes</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2129" begin="55410777505t" end="55442895006t" region="region36" style="style0">from your sails</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2130" begin="55442895006t" end="55455399999t" region="region33" style="style0">and look at everything</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2131" begin="55442895006t" end="55455399999t" region="region37" style="style0">I've done.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2132" begin="55475837500t" end="55494197508t" region="region65" style="style0">What Osiris never could.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2133" begin="55494197508t" end="55510460003t" region="region53" style="style0">I rule all that breathes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2134" begin="55522975006t" end="55538402502t" region="region10" style="style0">And all that is</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2135" begin="55522975006t" end="55538402502t" region="region59" style="style0">breathed upon.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2136" begin="55553005006t" end="55576355000t" region="region21" style="style0">None is mightier</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2137" begin="55553005006t" end="55576355000t" region="region30" style="style0">below the sun.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2138" begin="55576355000t" end="55612230006t" region="region13" style="style0">as I've honored you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2139" begin="55576355000t" end="55612230006t" region="region38" style="style0">Then honor me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2140" begin="55612230006t" end="55626822500t" region="region2" style="style0">If honor had been your intent,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2141" begin="55626822500t" end="55656852500t" region="region19" style="style0">from murdering your brother.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2142" begin="55626822500t" end="55656852500t" region="region4" style="style0">you might have abstained</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2143" begin="55656852500t" end="55687717501t" region="region18" style="style0">everything down there.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2144" begin="55656852500t" end="55687717501t" region="region38" style="style0">So you do see</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2145" begin="55687717501t" end="55721087505t" region="region53" style="style0">do you care what happens?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2146" begin="55687717501t" end="55721087505t" region="region52" style="style0">Tell me, Father,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2147" begin="55742360006t" end="55774895008t" region="region28" style="style0">I care more than you know.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2148" begin="55774895008t" end="55792827506t" region="region1" style="style0">I cast out alone</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2149" begin="55774895008t" end="55792827506t" region="region75" style="style0">Then why was</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2150" begin="55809925003t" end="55830362503t" region="region27" style="style0">to walk on burning sand</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2151" begin="55809925003t" end="55830362503t" region="region88" style="style0">(WHISPERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2152" begin="55844130007t" end="55874577508t" region="region21" style="style0">while my brother</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2153" begin="55844130007t" end="55874577508t" region="region36" style="style0">played barefoot</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2154" begin="55874577508t" end="55889170002t" region="region28" style="style0">by the shores of the Nile?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2155" begin="55916277500t" end="55938385001t" region="region21" style="style0">Why did you make</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2156" begin="55916277500t" end="55938385001t" region="region5" style="style0">Osiris King?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2157" begin="55938385001t" end="55973007506t" region="region10" style="style0">And why did you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2158" begin="55938385001t" end="55973007506t" region="region36" style="style0">give him a son?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2159" begin="55973007506t" end="56000950003t" region="region58" style="style0">the chance to even give life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2160" begin="55973007506t" end="56000950003t" region="region54" style="style0">And yet you denied me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2161" begin="56000950003t" end="56023057506t" region="region40" style="style0">This was your test.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2162" begin="56023057506t" end="56036815000t" region="region13" style="style0">You didn't test him.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2163" begin="56036815000t" end="56057670001t" region="region40" style="style0">the crown of Egypt.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2164" begin="56036815000t" end="56057670001t" region="region38" style="style0">I gave Osiris</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2165" begin="56072272506t" end="56116477500t" region="region58" style="style0">he didn't cling to his power.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2166" begin="56072272506t" end="56116477500t" region="region41" style="style0">And when the time came,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2167" begin="56116477500t" end="56160275003t" region="region41" style="style0">He gave it away freely.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2168" begin="56116477500t" end="56160275003t" region="region40" style="style0">He passed his test.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2169" begin="56160275003t" end="56176955000t" region="region42" style="style0">I've passed mine.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2170" begin="56160275003t" end="56176955000t" region="region38" style="style0">And I'd wager</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2171" begin="56176955000t" end="56194062507t" region="region76" style="style0">Not yet.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2172" begin="56199480002t" end="56219082502t" region="region5" style="style0">It's true...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2173" begin="56219082502t" end="56237850001t" region="region43" style="style0">I did not want you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2174" begin="56219082502t" end="56237850001t" region="region42" style="style0">to have children.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2175" begin="56246607500t" end="56266627500t" region="region13" style="style0">This was a kindness,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2176" begin="56266627500t" end="56285822508t" region="region35" style="style0">because I did not want you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2177" begin="56266627500t" end="56285822508t" region="region5" style="style0">to miss them</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2178" begin="56285822508t" end="56299580002t" region="region18" style="style0">as terribly as I have.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2179" begin="56299580002t" end="56313765006t" region="region37" style="style0">Miss them?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2180" begin="56326687500t" end="56342125005t" region="region42" style="style0">to take my place.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2181" begin="56326687500t" end="56342125005t" region="region62" style="style0">I need you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2182" begin="56366727500t" end="56379660002t" region="region78" style="style0">Here?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2183" begin="56379660002t" end="56406767500t" region="region44" style="style0">test ends, my son.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2184" begin="56379660002t" end="56406767500t" region="region21" style="style0">This is how your</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2185" begin="56406767500t" end="56426369999t" region="region56" style="style0">There is no greater burden.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2186" begin="56451400003t" end="56464332507t" region="region3" style="style0">But no greater honor.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2187" begin="56496857500t" end="56525645008t" region="region51" style="style0">All you have done</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2188" begin="56496857500t" end="56525645008t" region="region55" style="style0">can be forgiven.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2189" begin="56586947500t" end="56632415005t" region="region33" style="style0">You expect me to joust</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2190" begin="56586947500t" end="56632415005t" region="region36" style="style0">with this beast</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2191" begin="56645765008t" end="56685387508t" region="region51" style="style0">night after night</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2192" begin="56645765008t" end="56685387508t" region="region89" style="style0">until I die?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2193" begin="56685387508t" end="56701232503t" region="region42" style="style0">What do you want?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2194" begin="56707067500t" end="56725010007t" region="region5" style="style0">Immortality.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2195" begin="56725010007t" end="56757117500t" region="region23" style="style0">Immortality awaits us all</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2196" begin="56725010007t" end="56757117500t" region="region42" style="style0">in the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2197" begin="56757117500t" end="56789235001t" region="region32" style="style0">I don't want to die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2198" begin="56757117500t" end="56789235001t" region="region36" style="style0">I want to live.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2199" begin="56789235001t" end="56805090007t" region="region76" style="style0">Forever.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2200" begin="56805090007t" end="56827187500t" region="region53" style="style0">in the lands I conquered.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2201" begin="56805090007t" end="56827187500t" region="region62" style="style0">Down there</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2202" begin="56827187500t" end="56837197500t" region="region25" style="style0">My kingdom.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2203" begin="56837197500t" end="56860975003t" region="region53" style="style0">This should be my reward.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2204" begin="56860975003t" end="56896015008t" region="region26" style="style0">How? The only way to achieve</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2205" begin="56860975003t" end="56896015008t" region="region13" style="style0">this is unthinkable.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2206" begin="56896015008t" end="56912277505t" region="region17" style="style0">One would need</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2207" begin="56896015008t" end="56912277505t" region="region5" style="style0">to devour...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2208" begin="56912277505t" end="56931045003t" region="region3" style="style0">The Afterlife itself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2209" begin="56931045003t" end="56956492508t" region="region41" style="style0">You would unleash Chaos</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2210" begin="56931045003t" end="56956492508t" region="region59" style="style0">upon creation?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2211" begin="56956492508t" end="56977337500t" region="region58" style="style0">You would destroy everything?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2212" begin="56977337500t" end="57006542508t" region="region65" style="style0">Not destroy. Reshape it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2213" begin="57006542508t" end="57030310002t" region="region27" style="style0">I will take your place.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2214" begin="57030310002t" end="57050747502t" region="region41" style="style0">But it won't be sitting</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2215" begin="57030310002t" end="57050747502t" region="region60" style="style0">on some damn boat.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2216" begin="57227587500t" end="57242607505t" region="region27" style="style0">(SET BREATHING HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2217" begin="57296832508t" end="57311842503t" region="region36" style="style0">withstand that.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2218" begin="57296832508t" end="57311842503t" region="region88" style="style0">No god could</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2219" begin="57327687500t" end="57348125000t" region="region3" style="style0">I'm not just one god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2220" begin="57360640002t" end="57374825006t" region="region66" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2221" begin="57715165006t" end="57742272503t" region="region2" style="style0">HEAD JUDGE: What do you offer?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2222" begin="57742272503t" end="57764797506t" region="region53" style="style0">a place in the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2223" begin="57742272503t" end="57764797506t" region="region51" style="style0">This will buy you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2224" begin="57764797506t" end="57777719999t" region="region61" style="style0">ZAYA: No.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2225" begin="57787322508t" end="57799410001t" region="region1" style="style0">Not without you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2226" begin="57826527508t" end="57838197500t" region="region37" style="style0">(RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2227" begin="57884917506t" end="57903267505t" region="region42" style="style0">(SOULS SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2228" begin="57903267505t" end="57927462508t" region="region53" style="style0">The gate has been broken!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2229" begin="57927462508t" end="57948307500t" region="region30" style="style0">Chaos spreads.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2230" begin="57948307500t" end="57962492503t" region="region44" style="style0">destroy this land.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2231" begin="57948307500t" end="57962492503t" region="region38" style="style0">Apophis shall</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2232" begin="58014212506t" end="58027969999t" region="region44" style="style0">(APOPHIS GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2233" begin="58076360007t" end="58098457500t" region="region30" style="style0">only hope now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2234" begin="58076360007t" end="58098457500t" region="region75" style="style0">Horus is our</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2235" begin="58098457500t" end="58111390002t" region="region18" style="style0">you think he is, Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2236" begin="58098457500t" end="58111390002t" region="region21" style="style0">He's not the god</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2237" begin="58111390002t" end="58127245008t" region="region30" style="style0">He lied to me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2238" begin="58127245008t" end="58145177506t" region="region65" style="style0">Give him another chance.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2239" begin="58145177506t" end="58165615006t" region="region32" style="style0">He only got this far</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2240" begin="58145177506t" end="58165615006t" region="region36" style="style0">because of you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2241" begin="58165615006t" end="58184382506t" region="region19" style="style0">My strength is not infinite.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2242" begin="58184382506t" end="58216917508t" region="region58" style="style0">has any plan to rectify this,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2243" begin="58184382506t" end="58216917508t" region="region97" style="style0">If the Lord of the Air</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2244" begin="58216917508t" end="58238597500t" region="region56" style="style0">he should do so with haste.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2245" begin="58238597500t" end="58267802508t" region="region41" style="style0">If you don't trust him,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2246" begin="58238597500t" end="58267802508t" region="region61" style="style0">trust me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2247" begin="58267802508t" end="58279890001t" region="region10" style="style0">I know we'll be</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2248" begin="58267802508t" end="58279890001t" region="region36" style="style0">together again.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2249" begin="58400427501t" end="58415030006t" region="region3" style="style0">HORUS: Ra has fallen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2250" begin="58415030006t" end="58433380003t" region="region65" style="style0">Set has unleashed Chaos.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2251" begin="58433380003t" end="58448389999t" region="region18" style="style0">So how do we stop him?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2252" begin="58469245000t" end="58488847500t" region="region28" style="style0">You never give up, do you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2253" begin="58488847500t" end="58504285005t" region="region13" style="style0">Zaya told me not to.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2254" begin="58488847500t" end="58504285005t" region="region75" style="style0">Only because</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2255" begin="58509285000t" end="58525557506t" region="region49" style="style0">about our bargain?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2256" begin="58509285000t" end="58525557506t" region="region0" style="style0">You didn't tell her</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2257" begin="58525557506t" end="58539315000t" region="region13" style="style0">Yes, I did tell her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2258" begin="58539315000t" end="58555587506t" region="region28" style="style0">she still believes in you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2259" begin="58539315000t" end="58555587506t" region="region32" style="style0">But for some reason,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2260" begin="58576025006t" end="58588529999t" region="region2" style="style0">We must return to the capital.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2261" begin="58598957500t" end="58613977505t" region="region4" style="style0">Then we have a long walk</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2262" begin="58598957500t" end="58613977505t" region="region5" style="style0">ahead of us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2263" begin="58625657506t" end="58641920002t" region="region1" style="style0">(BIRDS CHIRPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2264" begin="58641920002t" end="58656522507t" region="region1" style="style0">I prefer flying.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2265" begin="58693222503t" end="58704485005t" region="region61" style="style0">Nephthys.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2266" begin="58709067500t" end="58731175001t" region="region65" style="style0">she's trying to help us.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2267" begin="58709067500t" end="58731175001t" region="region43" style="style0">Even beyond death,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2268" begin="58785400006t" end="58796662507t" region="region44" style="style0">(THUNDER RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2269" begin="58903850003t" end="58918859999t" region="region5" style="style0">Come, demon!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2270" begin="59008125008t" end="59020212500t" region="region37" style="style0">(GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2271" begin="59189547500t" end="59211237501t" region="region28" style="style0">HORUS: Set has Ra's spear.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2272" begin="59211237501t" end="59227510007t" region="region32" style="style0">He's drawing Apophis</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2273" begin="59211237501t" end="59227510007t" region="region5" style="style0">to the Nile,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2274" begin="59227510007t" end="59235432506t" region="region28" style="style0">to the source of all life.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2275" begin="59235432506t" end="59253365003t" region="region11" style="style0">Why?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2276" begin="59253365003t" end="59289647500t" region="region65" style="style0">To destroy all creation.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2277" begin="59253365003t" end="59289647500t" region="region75" style="style0">To drink it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2278" begin="59289647500t" end="59309667500t" region="region35" style="style0">Ra isn't dead. And only he</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2279" begin="59289647500t" end="59309667500t" region="region13" style="style0">can make this right.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2280" begin="59309667500t" end="59329687500t" region="region27" style="style0">But he needs his spear.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2281" begin="59329687500t" end="59342202502t" region="region53" style="style0">So how do we get it back?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2282" begin="59351377501t" end="59369309999t" region="region10" style="style0">Maybe it's time</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2283" begin="59351377501t" end="59369309999t" region="region59" style="style0">we go fishing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2284" begin="59438137508t" end="59459817500t" region="region19" style="style0">(URSHU PRAYING INDISTINCTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2285" begin="59459817500t" end="59486935006t" region="region41" style="style0">I come in your service,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2286" begin="59459817500t" end="59486935006t" region="region99" style="style0">I ask for your help.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2287" begin="59486935006t" end="59499032508t" region="region36" style="style0">HORUS: Builder.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2288" begin="59486935006t" end="59499032508t" region="region105" style="style0">(GASPS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2289" begin="59518217508t" end="59532810002t" region="region13" style="style0">We have need of you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2290" begin="59532810002t" end="59549489999t" region="region37" style="style0">(RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2291" begin="59579937500t" end="59593287502t" region="region40" style="style0">(SOLDIERS SHOUTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2292" begin="59720077500t" end="59749282508t" region="region23" style="style0">It is the single greatest</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2293" begin="59720077500t" end="59749282508t" region="region53" style="style0">architectural achievement</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2294" begin="59749282508t" end="59766380006t" region="region42" style="style0">and ever will be.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2295" begin="59749282508t" end="59766380006t" region="region38" style="style0">that ever was</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2296" begin="59775972506t" end="59789729999t" region="region78" style="style0">My...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2297" begin="59800157500t" end="59840197500t" region="region44" style="style0">Lord Set's obelisk</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2298" begin="59800157500t" end="59840197500t" region="region105" style="style0">I mean,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2299" begin="59840197500t" end="59886917506t" region="region44" style="style0">2,220 cubits tall.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2300" begin="59840197500t" end="59886917506t" region="region17" style="style0">stands exactly</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2301" begin="59886917506t" end="59901927501t" region="region44" style="style0">And not a rod off.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2302" begin="59901927501t" end="59924035003t" region="region4" style="style0">Built from seven billion</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2303" begin="59901927501t" end="59924035003t" region="region44" style="style0">blocks of granite,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2304" begin="59924035003t" end="59952812502t" region="region43" style="style0">five billion slabs</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2305" begin="59924035003t" end="59952812502t" region="region44" style="style0">of Tura limestone,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2306" begin="59952812502t" end="59980337500t" region="region4" style="style0">and nine billion talents</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2307" begin="59952812502t" end="59980337500t" region="region76" style="style0">of gold.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2308" begin="59980337500t" end="59994940003t" region="region40" style="style0">of how many slaves?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2309" begin="59980337500t" end="59994940003t" region="region38" style="style0">And the lives</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2310" begin="60006620006t" end="60044155003t" region="region47" style="style0">5,930.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2311" begin="60044155003t" end="60057922507t" region="region61" style="style0">No, wait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2312" begin="60068350007t" end="60107555006t" region="region1" style="style0">Make that 5,931.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2313" begin="60107555006t" end="60124652503t" region="region0" style="style0">Don't! You need him</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2314" begin="60107555006t" end="60124652503t" region="region40" style="style0">to get to the roof.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2315" begin="60157605006t" end="60170109999t" region="region56" style="style0">HORUS: I'll see you up top.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2316" begin="60230587500t" end="60247695006t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2317" begin="60466662506t" end="60490429999t" region="region28" style="style0">as if he were your friend.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2318" begin="60466662506t" end="60490429999t" region="region32" style="style0">You stood beside him</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2319" begin="60500857500t" end="60515460003t" region="region39" style="style0">how it feels.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2320" begin="60500857500t" end="60515460003t" region="region62" style="style0">Oh, I know</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2321" begin="60515460003t" end="60534645003t" region="region36" style="style0">Favor of a god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2322" begin="60534645003t" end="60554665003t" region="region44" style="style0">It's intoxicating.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2323" begin="60554665003t" end="60580937500t" region="region65" style="style0">the wrong one to follow.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2324" begin="60554665003t" end="60580937500t" region="region32" style="style0">I'm sorry you picked</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2325" begin="60580937500t" end="60593870002t" region="region36" style="style0">He's improving.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2326" begin="60593870002t" end="60617647506t" region="region4" style="style0">Your woman's still dead,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2327" begin="60593870002t" end="60617647506t" region="region37" style="style0">isn't she?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2328" begin="60617647506t" end="60651007500t" region="region40" style="style0">Such a pretty girl.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2329" begin="60617647506t" end="60651007500t" region="region126" style="style0">Shame.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2330" begin="60651007500t" end="60661017500t" region="region47" style="style0">Hmm...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2331" begin="60661017500t" end="60681455000t" region="region18" style="style0">Such lovely soft skin.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2332" begin="60681455000t" end="60703980002t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2333" begin="60726922506t" end="60746107505t" region="region53" style="style0">Riches for the Afterlife.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2334" begin="60746107505t" end="60761117500t" region="region5" style="style0">(BEK COUGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2335" begin="60761117500t" end="60779477508t" region="region28" style="style0">You see? I'm ready to die.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2336" begin="60849965008t" end="60862052500t" region="region5" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNT)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2337" begin="60971327500t" end="60985930003t" region="region44" style="style0">(APOPHIS GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2338" begin="61093117501t" end="61108137506t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2339" begin="61186130003t" end="61201139999t" region="region40" style="style0">(METALLIC RATTLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2340" begin="61292482500t" end="61320435008t" region="region40" style="style0">SET: Come, Apophis!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2341" begin="61410525008t" end="61423030001t" region="region44" style="style0">(THUNDER RUMBLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2342" begin="61473497501t" end="61490605008t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2343" begin="61574432502t" end="61596957505t" region="region18" style="style0">stayed under the sand.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2344" begin="61574432502t" end="61596957505t" region="region10" style="style0">You should have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2345" begin="61596957505t" end="61611967500t" region="region13" style="style0">killing for a crown,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2346" begin="61596957505t" end="61611967500t" region="region21" style="style0">I can understand</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2347" begin="61611967500t" end="61628240006t" region="region13" style="style0">but this is madness.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2348" begin="61628240006t" end="61644920002t" region="region3" style="style0">you don't understand.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2349" begin="61628240006t" end="61644920002t" region="region50" style="style0">Of course</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2350" begin="61644920002t" end="61660357508t" region="region30" style="style0">How could you?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2351" begin="61660357508t" end="61675367502t" region="region42" style="style0">of a favored son.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2352" begin="61660357508t" end="61675367502t" region="region63" style="style0">Favored son</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2353" begin="61729175006t" end="61741679999t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2354" begin="62039485006t" end="62051989999t" region="region39" style="style0">(BEK YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2355" begin="62139167506t" end="62152507500t" region="region61" style="style0">(GAGGING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2356" begin="62152507500t" end="62169615006t" region="region25" style="style0">By the way,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2357" begin="62169615006t" end="62190470007t" region="region41" style="style0">Apophis is going to eat</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2358" begin="62169615006t" end="62190470007t" region="region3" style="style0">the Land of the Dead.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2359" begin="62190470007t" end="62204645001t" region="region96" style="style0">You'll never make it</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2360" begin="62190470007t" end="62204645001t" region="region3" style="style0">to the Afterlife now.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2361" begin="62204645001t" end="62219247506t" region="region36" style="style0">(STRAINS) What?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2362" begin="62248860006t" end="62262199999t" region="region61" style="style0">(YELLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2363" begin="62294735001t" end="62313920001t" region="region58" style="style0">Who picked the wrong god now?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2364" begin="62444885001t" end="62459070006t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2365" begin="62572927500t" end="62587112503t" region="region36" style="style0">(BOTH GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2366" begin="62630910007t" end="62663017500t" region="region71" style="style0">I think I may actually miss</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2367" begin="62630910007t" end="62663017500t" region="region53" style="style0">our little get-togethers.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2368" begin="62672202508t" end="62683872500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2369" begin="62713485000t" end="62735592502t" region="region21" style="style0">But you're still</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2370" begin="62713485000t" end="62735592502t" region="region1" style="style0">no match for me.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2371" begin="62746855003t" end="62761875008t" region="region39" style="style0">You're right.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2372" begin="62777302503t" end="62792322508t" region="region44" style="style0">I'm just the bait.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2373" begin="62850295006t" end="62862799999t" region="region10" style="style0">Now you're just</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2374" begin="62850295006t" end="62862799999t" region="region1" style="style0">becoming a pest.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2375" begin="62876150002t" end="62890752507t" region="region5" style="style0">(SET GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2376" begin="62895752502t" end="62910355006t" region="region30" style="style0">(BEK EXCLAIMS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2377" begin="62962075008t" end="62974162500t" region="region5" style="style0">(BEK GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2378" begin="62992522508t" end="63004192500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2379" begin="63046320002t" end="63063835000t" region="region47" style="style0">Horus!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2380" begin="63283637500t" end="63294900001t" region="region66" style="style0">(YELLS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2381" begin="63345367501t" end="63359970006t" region="region37" style="style0">(GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2382" begin="63404175000t" end="63421282507t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2383" begin="63485507501t" end="63503032508t" region="region4" style="style0">You don't think your eye</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2384" begin="63485507501t" end="63503032508t" region="region36" style="style0">might have been</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2385" begin="63503032508t" end="63516790002t" region="region3" style="style0">than a wounded thief?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2386" begin="63503032508t" end="63516790002t" region="region63" style="style0">more useful</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2387" begin="63516790002t" end="63531392507t" region="region30" style="style0">Probably, yes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2388" begin="63553907500t" end="63573509999t" region="region4" style="style0">I'm sorry for everything</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2389" begin="63553907500t" end="63573509999t" region="region42" style="style0">I've done to you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2390" begin="63576432502t" end="63593947500t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2391" begin="63593947500t" end="63606880002t" region="region36" style="style0">Including this.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2392" begin="63606880002t" end="63621065006t" region="region61" style="style0">Accepted.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2393" begin="63917190002t" end="63953065008t" region="region53" style="style0">I'd steal your other eye.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2394" begin="63917190002t" end="63953065008t" region="region54" style="style0">(CHUCKLES) I told you</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2395" begin="63953065008t" end="63965152500t" region="region3" style="style0">saved me some trouble</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2396" begin="63953065008t" end="63965152500t" region="region67" style="style0">But you could have</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2397" begin="63965152500t" end="63978920003t" region="region40" style="style0">you didn't need it.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2398" begin="63965152500t" end="63978920003t" region="region63" style="style0">and told me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2399" begin="63978920003t" end="63999357505t" region="region3" style="style0">Ra showed me the way,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2400" begin="63999357505t" end="64015202500t" region="region13" style="style0">but I didn't listen.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2401" begin="64015202500t" end="64040232506t" region="region35" style="style0">I believed I needed my eye</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2402" begin="64015202500t" end="64040232506t" region="region39" style="style0">to transform,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2403" begin="64040232506t" end="64067340002t" region="region26" style="style0">but my journey isn't to seek</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2404" begin="64040232506t" end="64067340002t" region="region3" style="style0">revenge at all costs.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2405" begin="64081107506t" end="64096952502t" region="region56" style="style0">It is to protect my people.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2406" begin="64108215003t" end="64133662508t" region="region0" style="style0">Stop congratulating</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2407" begin="64108215003t" end="64133662508t" region="region61" style="style0">yourself.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2408" begin="64133662508t" end="64144497500t" region="region42" style="style0">protecting to do.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2409" begin="64133662508t" end="64144497500t" region="region10" style="style0">You've got more</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2410" begin="64281307506t" end="64294229999t" region="region36" style="style0">(GROANS SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2411" begin="64398922503t" end="64413942508t" region="region42" style="style0">(PEOPLE CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2412" begin="64789312503t" end="64803915008t" region="region30" style="style0">(SET GRUNTING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2413" begin="64861052506t" end="64874809999t" region="region30" style="style0">(SET GROANING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2414" begin="64925695000t" end="64937792502t" region="region25" style="style0">(SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2415" begin="64985755000t" end="65002862507t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2416" begin="65095447500t" end="65105457500t" region="region44" style="style0">(APOPHIS GROWLING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2417" begin="65105457500t" end="65120477505t" region="region13" style="style0">(SOLDIERS SCREAMING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2418" begin="65350707505t" end="65366970001t" region="region42" style="style0">(GROANING SOFTLY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2419" begin="65495847500t" end="65511285005t" region="region37" style="style0">(COUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2420" begin="65540480003t" end="65555489999t" region="region40" style="style0">(BREATHING HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2421" begin="65583860007t" end="65625559999t" region="region3" style="style0">Behold, the new King.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2422" begin="65645997500t" end="65671027505t" region="region58" style="style0">the greatest of all the gods.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2423" begin="65645997500t" end="65671027505t" region="region67" style="style0">I thought you were</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2424" begin="65671027505t" end="65691882506t" region="region1" style="style0">Now look at you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2425" begin="65671027505t" end="65691882506t" region="region82" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2426" begin="65691882506t" end="65711902506t" region="region42" style="style0">You have nothing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2427" begin="65711902506t" end="65735669999t" region="region18" style="style0">I am the greatest god.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2428" begin="65746097500t" end="65759447502t" region="region44" style="style0">I spared you once.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2429" begin="65766535000t" end="65776127500t" region="region11" style="style0">Huh?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2430" begin="65776127500t" end="65797817501t" region="region40" style="style0">I showed you mercy.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2431" begin="65797817501t" end="65814507508t" region="region28" style="style0">I won't make that mistake.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2432" begin="65822847506t" end="65835769999t" region="region76" style="style0">(GRUNTS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2433" begin="65999270002t" end="66019707502t" region="region0" style="style0">HORUS: Grandfather,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2434" begin="65999270002t" end="66019707502t" region="region40" style="style0">there's still time.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2435" begin="66071427505t" end="66086019999t" region="region30" style="style0">Enough, beast!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2436" begin="66146497500t" end="66161100003t" region="region1" style="style0">(APOPHIS GROANS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2437" begin="66347115000t" end="66364222507t" region="region66" style="style0">(SIGHS)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2438" begin="66870140002t" end="66884325006t" region="region37" style="style0">Thank you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2439" begin="66925200007t" end="66940627502t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2440" begin="66947297500t" end="66960230002t" region="region37" style="style0">(APPLAUSE)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2441" begin="66985677508t" end="67004445006t" region="region56" style="style0">HORUS: We make a good team.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2442" begin="67004445006t" end="67025717508t" region="region42" style="style0">you're not a god?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2443" begin="67004445006t" end="67025717508t" region="region88" style="style0">Are you sure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2444" begin="67025717508t" end="67047397500t" region="region56" style="style0">What would I be the god of?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2445" begin="67047397500t" end="67063252506t" region="region42" style="style0">(EXHALES HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2446" begin="67063252506t" end="67077009999t" region="region37" style="style0">Stupidity?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2447" begin="67092030003t" end="67106632508t" region="region36" style="style0">The Impossible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2448" begin="67150420002t" end="67164605006t" region="region11" style="style0">Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2449" begin="67701805003t" end="67720572502t" region="region51" style="style0">I have never been</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2450" begin="67701805003t" end="67720572502t" region="region70" style="style0">in debt.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2451" begin="67720572502t" end="67743097505t" region="region32" style="style0">And yet I am in debt</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2452" begin="67720572502t" end="67743097505t" region="region42" style="style0">to you, grandson.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2453" begin="67753942506t" end="67778127500t" region="region18" style="style0">Ask whatever you will.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2454" begin="67778127500t" end="67801905003t" region="region32" style="style0">Mountains will kneel</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2455" begin="67778127500t" end="67801905003t" region="region25" style="style0">before you.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2456" begin="67801905003t" end="67818167500t" region="region3" style="style0">will do your bidding.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2457" begin="67801905003t" end="67818167500t" region="region50" style="style0">The winds</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2458" begin="67818167500t" end="67843197505t" region="region28" style="style0">for Apophis still hungers.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2459" begin="67818167500t" end="67843197505t" region="region10" style="style0">Answer quickly,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2460" begin="67856547508t" end="67875732507t" region="region56" style="style0">And night is always coming.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2461" begin="67917442508t" end="67929530001t" region="region36" style="style0">I want nothing.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2462" begin="67949967501t" end="67967899999t" region="region4" style="style0">Except what's impossible</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2463" begin="67949967501t" end="67967899999t" region="region36" style="style0">for me to give.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2464" begin="68142245003t" end="68159760001t" region="region61" style="style0">(GASPING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2465" begin="68228995000t" end="68248597500t" region="region66" style="style0">Am I...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2466" begin="68248597500t" end="68269035000t" region="region71" style="style0">(CHUCKLES) You've returned.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2467" begin="68248597500t" end="68269035000t" region="region64" style="style0">(LAUGHING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2468" begin="68269035000t" end="68287812508t" region="region25" style="style0">HORUS: Bek?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2469" begin="68287812508t" end="68298647500t" region="region42" style="style0">want to help her.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2470" begin="68287812508t" end="68298647500t" region="region50" style="style0">You might</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2471" begin="68319502500t" end="68337445008t" region="region78" style="style0">Zaya.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2472" begin="68364970006t" end="68378309999t" region="region27" style="style0">(ZAYA BREATHES HEAVILY)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2473" begin="68386660007t" end="68403340003t" region="region39" style="style0">(SOFTLY) Bek.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2474" begin="68403340003t" end="68417942508t" region="region5" style="style0">HORUS: Zaya?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2475" begin="68425030006t" end="68437127508t" region="region37" style="style0">I'm Horus.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2476" begin="68437127508t" end="68448797500t" region="region76" style="style0">My Lord.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2477" begin="68448797500t" end="68463400003t" region="region83" style="style0">I thought this</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2478" begin="68448797500t" end="68463400003t" region="region36" style="style0">was impossible.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2479" begin="68463400003t" end="68488419999t" region="region1" style="style0">Impossible? Yes.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2480" begin="68568917500t" end="68579762500t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2481" begin="68579762500t" end="68608539999t" region="region2" style="style0">CROWD: Hail Ra, Lord of Light!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2482" begin="68626065006t" end="68651502502t" region="region27" style="style0">Hail Ra, Lord of Light!</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2483" begin="68679027500t" end="68704892506t" region="region18" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2484" begin="68679027500t" end="68704892506t" region="region51" style="style0">OLDER BEK:</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2485" begin="68704892506t" end="68739087500t" region="region33" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2486" begin="68704892506t" end="68739087500t" region="region3" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2487" begin="68739087500t" end="68756195006t" region="region30" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2488" begin="68756195006t" end="68776215006t" region="region44" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2489" begin="68776215006t" end="68802070002t" region="region28" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2490" begin="68802070002t" end="68827935008t" region="region35" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2491" begin="68802070002t" end="68827935008t" region="region40" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2492" begin="68827935008t" end="68848372508t" region="region127" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2493" begin="68827935008t" end="68848372508t" region="region9" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2494" begin="68848372508t" end="68881315001t" region="region14" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2495" begin="68848372508t" end="68881315001t" region="region15" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2496" begin="68881315001t" end="68933035003t" region="region111" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2497" begin="68881315001t" end="68933035003t" region="region28" style="style0"></p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2498" begin="68933035003t" end="68943880003t" region="region13" style="style0">You think I'm ready?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2499" begin="68943880003t" end="68969317500t" region="region40" style="style0">Hmm, true readiness</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2500" begin="68969317500t" end="69003522503t" region="region35" style="style0">is a notoriously difficult</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2501" begin="68969317500t" end="69003522503t" region="region42" style="style0">state to achieve.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2502" begin="69003522503t" end="69028960000t" region="region23" style="style0">-But you're close enough.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2503" begin="69003522503t" end="69028960000t" region="region78" style="style0">-Hmm.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2504" begin="69157430007t" end="69184537505t" region="region36" style="style0">Arise, Horus...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2505" begin="69184537505t" end="69210810001t" region="region44" style="style0">King of all Egypt.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2506" begin="69255860006t" end="69269200000t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2507" begin="69305492506t" end="69330095000t" region="region13" style="style0">From this moment on,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2508" begin="69330095000t" end="69352202502t" region="region48" style="style0">the Afterlife must be earned,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2509" begin="69330095000t" end="69352202502t" region="region59" style="style0">not with gold,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2510" begin="69368892508t" end="69397252507t" region="region43" style="style0">but by good deeds,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2511" begin="69368892508t" end="69397252507t" region="region25" style="style0">compassion,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2512" begin="69407680007t" end="69420602500t" region="region36" style="style0">and generosity.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2513" begin="69429777500t" end="69468575008t" region="region33" style="style0">What we do, how we act</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2514" begin="69429777500t" end="69468575008t" region="region3" style="style0">in this life matters.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2515" begin="69482750002t" end="69499430000t" region="region1" style="style0">(CROWD CHEERING)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2516" begin="69543645003t" end="69558247508t" region="region21" style="style0">Are you thinking</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2517" begin="69543645003t" end="69558247508t" region="region37" style="style0">about her?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2518" begin="69579927500t" end="69594947505t" region="region40" style="style0">Of course, you are.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2519" begin="69635822506t" end="69653337502t" region="region48" style="style0">You didn't think I'd misplace</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2520" begin="69635822506t" end="69653337502t" region="region81" style="style0">Egypt's greatest treasure?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2521" begin="69670435000t" end="69697970007t" region="region28" style="style0">if I were gone a few days?</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2522" begin="69670435000t" end="69697970007t" region="region4" style="style0">You think they'd miss me</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2523" begin="69697970007t" end="69720067500t" region="region21" style="style0">As Chief Advisor</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2524" begin="69697970007t" end="69720067500t" region="region5" style="style0">to the King,</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2525" begin="69720067500t" end="69740087500t" region="region33" style="style0">it's my duty to ensure</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2526" begin="69720067500t" end="69740087500t" region="region40" style="style0">they hardly notice.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2527" begin="69740087500t" end="69760107500t" region="region28" style="style0">BEK: But if anyone asks...</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2528" begin="69740087500t" end="69760107500t" region="region46" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2529" begin="69760107500t" end="69776797506t" region="region13" style="style0">to go help a friend.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2530" begin="69760107500t" end="69776797506t" region="region10" style="style0">Tell them I had</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2531" begin="69800147500t" end="69827682507t" region="region18" style="style0">in your capable hands.</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2532" begin="69800147500t" end="69827682507t" region="region38" style="style0">I leave Egypt</p>
<p xml:id="subtitle2533" begin="69839362508t" end="69849780000t" region="region37" style="style0">(CHUCKLES)</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
